window.MODTESTS={"tefl-m1": [{"id": "tefl-m01-test-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m01-test-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which feature of English makes it comparatively easy for learners?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which feature makes English easier to learn?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي سمة في الإنجليزي بتخليها أسهل نسبيًا للمتعلمين؟</div>", "o": ["Marks on letters that show pronunciation", "A mostly fixed word order (SVO) and weak inflection", "Tones that change word meaning", "Spelling that always matches sound"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: English has almost no marks on letters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الإنجليزي تقريبًا مفيهوش علامات على الحروف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: SVO order and few word endings keep the system simple.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: ترتيب <span class=\"en\">SVO</span> وقلة نهايات الكلمات بيبسّطوا النظام.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: English is not tonal. Tones are a difficulty for tonal-language speakers.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الإنجليزي مش نغمي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: sound and spelling often do not match. This is the biggest problem.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الإملاء والنطق غالبًا مش متطابقين.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-A:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following are listed as hard parts of English for many learners? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are hard for learners? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مما يلي مذكور كأجزاء صعبة في الإنجليزي لكتير من المتعلمين؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["The articles a, an and the", "Sounds such as 'th'", "The fixed SVO word order", "Phrasal verbs"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: hard especially when the first language has none.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: صعبة خصوصًا لو اللغة الأولى مفيهاش أدوات.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they need the tongue tip, which some languages never use.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتحتاج طرف اللسان وبعض اللغات مبتستخدمهوش.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: fixed order is a feature that makes English easier.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الترتيب الثابت بيسهّل الإنجليزي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they are very common in speech and can look like nonsense to a beginner.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: شائعة جدًا في الكلام وممكن تبان بلا معنى للمبتدئ.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-A:3", "type": "mc3", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Spanish is syllable-timed. What effect does this often have on Spanish learners' English?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What happens to a Spanish student's English rhythm?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الإسباني لغة مقطعية الزمن. إيه تأثير ده على إنجليزي المتعلم الإسباني؟</div>", "o": ["It has no effect on listeners", "It sounds too fast, because stress is added to every word", "It can sound flat and robotic, because every syllable gets equal time"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: native listeners can miss the important words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: السامع ممكن يفوّت الكلمات المهمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the problem is lack of stress contrast, not extra stress.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المشكلة غياب التباين في النبر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: English is stress-timed, so listeners miss the important words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الإنجليزي نبري، فالسامع بيفوّت الكلمات المهمة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-A:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The lesson says teachers should never use students' L1 in class.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false: never use L1.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الدرس بيقول إن المدرّس لازم ميستخدمش لغة الطلاب الأولى خالص.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the lesson sees L1 as another classroom resource, used with good judgment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الدرس بيشوف الـ <span class=\"en\">L1</span> مورد إضافي بيتستخدم بحُسن تقدير.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: there are seven practical reasons to use it, such as clarifying meaning and saving time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: فيه سبع أسباب عملية لاستخدامه زي توضيح المعنى وتوفير الوقت.</div>"], "l": "tefl-03"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A competent teacher is defined with the mnemonic KASH. Which option lists its four parts?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What are the four parts of KASH?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المدرّس الكفء بيتعرّف بالاختصار KASH. أي اختيار بيعدد أجزاءه الأربعة؟</div>", "o": ["Knowledge, Accuracy, Support, Hard work", "Knowledge, Attitude, Style, Humour", "Kindness, Authority, Speed, Honesty", "Knowledge, Ability, Skills, Habits"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the parts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش الأجزاء.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: attitude, style and humour are not parts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دول مش أجزاء الاختصار.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: these are not the parts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دول مش الأجزاء.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-05"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The teacher asks 'Who is student A? How much time?' after explaining a role-play. What are these questions called and why are they used?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What are these questions and why use them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المدرّس بيسأل <span class=\"en\">Who is student A? How much time?</span> بعد شرح لعب الأدوار. اسمهم إيه وليه بيتستخدموا؟</div>", "o": ["Icebreaker questions, to relax the class", "Elicitation questions, to test students' vocabulary", "Instruction Check Questions, because nodding students may not really understand", "Peer-feedback questions, to grade classmates"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are not icebreakers.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش كسر جليد.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: eliciting pulls out words, ICQs check the task.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الـ <span class=\"en\">elicit</span> بيستخرج كلمات، والـ <span class=\"en\">ICQs</span> بتتأكد من المهمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: ICQs check understanding before the task starts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتتأكد من الفهم قبل بدء المهمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are about instructions, not grading.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: عن التعليمات مش تقييم.</div>"], "l": "tefl-07"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m01-test-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m01-test-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A learner who forgets a word explains it with other words ('the tool you use to turn small metal things'). Which speaking strategy is this?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What speaking strategy is this?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">متعلم نسي كلمة وشرحها بكلمات تانية. أي استراتيجية كلام دي؟</div>", "o": ["Inference", "Summarising", "Circumlocution", "Deduction"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: inference is working out meaning from clues.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الاستنتاج هو استخراج المعنى من القرائن.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: summarising is a reading strategy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: التلخيص استراتيجية قراءة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: talking around a word you do not know.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتتكلم حوالين الكلمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: deduction is used for reading and writing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الاستدلال للقراءة والكتابة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-04"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-B:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following are among the 19 traits of a competent teacher? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are good teacher traits? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مما يلي من الصفات الـ 19 للمدرّس الكفء؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Adjust your own level of English to suit the class", "Give clear, precise instructions", "Reduce teacher talking time and maximise student talking time", "Set low expectations so students feel safe"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: there are no prizes for fancy language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: مفيش جوايز للغة المعقدة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it is trait 8.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: دي الصفة 8.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: teachers talk far too much.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المدرّسين بيتكلموا كتير زيادة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: set high, yet achievable, expectations.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: حط توقعات عالية لكن ممكنة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-06"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-B:3", "type": "mc3", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which icebreaker has students find one person for each item on a handout and ask follow-up questions?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which icebreaker uses a handout and moving around?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط كسر جليد بيخلي الطلاب يلاقوا شخص لكل بند في ورقة ويسألوا أسئلة متابعة؟</div>", "o": ["Introduce Your Partner", "Teacher Tic Tac Toe", "Find Someone Who"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: pairs interview each other and then present.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: أزواج بيعملوا مقابلة ثم يقدموا.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: two teams guess questions from a board.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فريقين بيخمنوا أسئلة من لوحة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: students mingle and ask follow-ups.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بيتحركوا ويسألوا أسئلة متابعة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-08"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-B:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Constructive feedback must always be positive and never mention problems.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">التغذية الراجعة البنّاءة لازم تكون إيجابية دايمًا ومتذكرش المشاكل.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: critical feedback given skilfully can be very useful.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: النقد المقدّم بمهارة مفيد جدًا.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: constructive does not mean only positive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: البنّاء مش معناه إيجابي بس.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which seating layout does the lesson give for opposing-team games?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which layout is for team games?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي ترتيب جلوس بيذكره الدرس لألعاب الفرق المتنافسة؟</div>", "o": ["Each team in its own corner", "A circle with the teacher inside", "Chairs facing each other in pairs", "A horseshoe"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: students get excited about beating the other side.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الطلاب بيتحمسوا يغلبوا الفريق التاني.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is for student-led lessons.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده للدرس اللي يقوده الطلاب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is for A/B role-play.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده للأدوار <span class=\"en\">A/B</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a horseshoe is for whole-class discussion.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الحدوة للمناقشة الجماعية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-07"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-B:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A Chinese learner says 'lake' when he means 'rake'. What does the lesson say about this?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why does a Chinese student say 'lake' for 'rake'?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">متعلم صيني بيقول <span class=\"en\">lake</span> وهو يقصد <span class=\"en\">rake</span>. إيه اللي بيقوله الدرس؟</div>", "o": ["It is caused by the English alphabet", "Chinese learners may confuse l and r", "Spanish speakers always do this", "Chinese has no consonant sounds"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the issue is sound, not the alphabet.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المشكلة صوتية مش الأبجدية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: so rake becomes lake and rice becomes lice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: فـ <span class=\"en\">rake</span> تبقى <span class=\"en\">lake</span> و<span class=\"en\">rice</span> تبقى <span class=\"en\">lice</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the lesson mentions this for Chinese learners.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الدرس بيذكره للصينيين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: Chinese has consonants.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الصيني فيه حروف ساكنة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m01-test-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m01-test-C:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is one of the seven reasons given for using L1 in class?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a reason to use L1?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي ده من الأسباب السبعة لاستخدام الـ <span class=\"en\">L1</span> في الفصل؟</div>", "o": ["To clarify meaning quickly when an idea is complex", "To replace English whenever students are tired", "To stop students asking questions", "To avoid teaching grammar"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: a similar L1 word gets to meaning faster.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: كلمة مشابهة بالـ <span class=\"en\">L1</span> توصل للمعنى أسرع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: L1 is used judiciously on specific occasions.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الـ <span class=\"en\">L1</span> بيتستخدم في مناسبات محددة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش سبب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a reason in the lesson.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش سبب في الدرس.</div>"], "l": "tefl-03"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-C:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following are among the six value groups of the Code of Practice? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are value groups? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مما يلي من مجموعات القيم الست في ميثاق الممارسة؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Speed and Efficiency", "Care and Protection", "Honesty and Integrity", "Fairness and Justice"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a value group.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مجموعة قيم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: value group 5.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المجموعة 5.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: value group 1.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المجموعة 1.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: value group 6.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المجموعة 6.</div>"], "l": "tefl-05"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-C:3", "type": "mc3", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Indirect communicators convey meaning through hints and stories. What does this usually mean?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does an indirect style usually show?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المتواصل غير المباشر بيوصّل المعنى بالتلميح والحكايات. ده غالبًا معناه إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Anger", "Politeness and respect for the other person", "Weak L2 proficiency"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not related.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مالوش علاقة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: do not read it as weak language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: متقراهوش كضعف لغة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a communication choice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده اختيار تواصل.</div>"], "l": "tefl-04"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-C:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">English is a tonal language: pitch changes the meaning of words.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الإنجليزي لغة نغمية: النغمة بتغيّر معنى الكلمات.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: in English pitch adds emphasis or emotion only.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: في الإنجليزي النغمة بتضيف تأكيد أو عاطفة بس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: tonal languages are, for example, Chinese and Vietnamese.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: اللغات النغمية زي الصيني والفيتنامي.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-C:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why does the lesson say to create a sense of community in the classroom?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why create a class community?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه الدرس بيقول اخلق إحساس بالمجتمع في الفصل؟</div>", "o": ["It removes the need for lesson planning", "It stops students speaking English", "The more comfortable students feel, the more they participate, learn and retain", "It lets the teacher talk more"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: planning remains essential.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: التخطيط لسه ضروري.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you should reduce teacher talk.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: لازم تقلل كلام المدرّس.</div>"], "l": "tefl-06"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-C:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why must a teacher be careful with peer feedback in a class of young learners?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why is peer feedback hard for young learners?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه المدرّس لازم يحترس من الـ <span class=\"en\">peer feedback</span> مع الصغار؟</div>", "o": ["They cannot yet think carefully about classmates' work, so detailed feedback is not realistic", "They dislike praise", "Young learners never make mistakes", "Peer feedback is forbidden by the Code"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: peer feedback is useful for all learners.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيد لكل المتعلمين.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m01-test-C.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-D", "model": "D", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m01-test-D:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does 'inflection' mean, and how does English compare?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is inflection?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">inflection</span> والإنجليزي إزاي؟</div>", "o": ["Extra endings added for grammar; English has only simple inflection", "Word order rules; English has none", "Tone changes that alter meaning; English has many", "Small marks on letters; English has many"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: regular verbs have just four forms.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: English has fixed SVO.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a tonal language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: those are diacritics.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-D:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Chinese learners may confuse 'he' and 'she' because both sound the same in Chinese.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">متعلمين الصينية ممكن يلخبطوا بين <span class=\"en\">he</span> و<span class=\"en\">she</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The two words sound the same in Chinese.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الكلمتين نفس النطق.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-D:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is a good use of L1 in the classroom?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a good use of L1?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي استخدام مناسب للغة الأم؟</div>", "o": ["Allowing students to avoid English all lesson", "Banning English in group work", "Translating every sentence", "Explaining a complex idea quickly so students avoid long confusion"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: use it with judgment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too much.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: used with good judgment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-03"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-D:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does KASH stand for?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does KASH mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه معنى <span class=\"en\">KASH</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Knowledge, Attitude, Style, Honesty", "Knowledge, Ability, Skills, Habits", "Keenness, Ability, Status, Habits", "Know-how, Authority, Skills, Help"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-05"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-D:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">For A/B role-play, which seating fits?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which seating?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي ترتيب جلوس؟</div>", "o": ["Islands", "A circle with the teacher inside", "Facing chairs or two centre rows", "A horseshoe"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: group work.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: student-led lessons.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: whole-class discussion.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-07"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-test-D:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which feedback rule is 'own it'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which rule is 'own it'?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنهي قاعدة <span class=\"en\">own it</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Say 'I think...' instead of presenting it as absolute truth", "Be specific", "Start positive", "Leave a choice"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a different rule.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a different rule.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a different rule.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m01-test-D.pdf"}], "tefl-m2": [{"id": "tefl-m02-test-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m02-test-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which CEFR level is described as 'understands the main points of clear standard input on familiar matters' and 'describes experiences, dreams, hopes and ambitions briefly'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which CEFR level is this?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مستوى <span class=\"en\">CEFR</span> ده اللي بيفهم النقاط الرئيسية للكلام الواضح عن مواضيع مألوفة ويوصف تجارب وأحلام بإيجاز؟</div>", "o": ["A2", "B2", "C1", "B1"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: A2 handles simple, routine tasks and frequent expressions.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">A2</span> للمهام الروتينية والعبارات الشائعة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: B2 understands complex text and explains viewpoints.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">B2</span> بيفهم النصوص المعقدة ويشرح وجهات النظر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: C1 follows demanding, longer texts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">C1</span> بيتابع نصوص طويلة صعبة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: B1 is the Threshold or Intermediate level.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">B1</span> هو مستوى <span class=\"en\">Threshold</span> أو المتوسط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-10"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-A:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which statements about the CEFR are correct? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which statements about the CEFR are true? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي عبارات عن الـ <span class=\"en\">CEFR</span> صح؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["It has six levels, from A1 to C2", "It is only for teaching English", "It is language-neutral, so it works for any language", "It uses can-do statements about what learners can do"], "a": [0, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it works for any language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بيشتغل مع أي لغة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: descriptors focus on ability, not on specific language knowledge.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الأوصاف بتركز على القدرة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-10"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the lesson, what is 'modelling' when teaching subject pronouns to absolute beginners?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is modelling?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه هو الـ <span class=\"en\">modelling</span> في تدريس الضمائر للمبتدئين تمامًا؟</div>", "o": ["Asking students to read silently", "Demonstrating exactly what you mean by pointing and using visuals", "Writing the whole list on the board for students to copy", "Using a model student as an example"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not modelling.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش <span class=\"en\">modelling</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: for example pointing to yourself and saying 'I am a teacher'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: زي ما تشاور على نفسك وتقول <span class=\"en\">I am a teacher</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the lesson says do not just write the list and ask students to copy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الدرس بيقول متكتبش القايمة بس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not what the term means.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش معنى المصطلح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-11"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-A:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Absolute beginners know nothing of English, while false beginners have picked up some English informally and may have bad habits.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المبتدئ المطلق معندوش أي معرفة بالإنجليزي، أما الـ <span class=\"en\">false beginner</span> اتعلم شوية بشكل غير رسمي وممكن يكون عنده عادات سيئة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Absolute beginners often catch up quickly, because their intrinsic motivation is high.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">المبتدئين المطلقين غالبًا بيلحقوا بسرعة لأن دافعيتهم الداخلية عالية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-11"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which pair is correct about 'have to' and 'don't have to'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What do 'have to' and 'don't have to' mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي زوج صح عن <span class=\"en\">have to</span> و<span class=\"en\">don't have to</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Both mean it is advisable", "'Have to' is obligatory; 'don't have to' is possible but not necessary, not forbidden", "They are exact opposites, and 'don't have to' means forbidden", "Both mean it is forbidden"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: advisable is 'should'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المستحب هو <span class=\"en\">should</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they are not exact opposites in the way you might expect.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: مش عكس تمامًا زي ما بنتوقع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: forbidden is 'must not' or 'cannot'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الممنوع هو <span class=\"en\">must not</span> أو <span class=\"en\">cannot</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: neither means forbidden.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ولا واحد معناه ممنوع.</div>"], "l": "tefl-12"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following is correct English but not a complete sentence?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is not a full sentence?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مما يلي إنجليزي صحيح لكنه مش جملة كاملة؟</div>", "o": ["He phoned.", "Will you help me?", "Made in France", "Carlos smiled."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has a subject and a verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فيها فاعل وفعل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has the subject 'you' and the verb 'will help'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فيها الفاعل <span class=\"en\">you</span> والفعل <span class=\"en\">will help</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it has no subject.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: مفيهاش فاعل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a complete simple sentence.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: جملة بسيطة كاملة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-15"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m02-test-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m02-test-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">At which level does the lesson's grammar map place relative clauses and the passive?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">At which level are relative clauses taught?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في أي مستوى بتتدرّس الجمل الموصولة والمبني للمجهول حسب خريطة القواعد؟</div>", "o": ["Beginner", "Intermediate", "Advanced", "Elementary"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: beginner covers pronouns, verb be and articles.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المبتدئ بيغطي الضمائر وفعل <span class=\"en\">be</span> والأدوات.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: intermediate includes passives, relative clauses and reported speech.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المتوسط فيه المبني للمجهول والجمل الموصولة والكلام المنقول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: advanced covers inversion, cleft sentences and mixed conditionals.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المتقدم بيغطي القلب والجمل المشقوقة والشرط المختلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: elementary covers present simple, past simple and so on.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الأساسي بيغطي المضارع البسيط والماضي البسيط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-10"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-B:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of these are among the nine tips for teaching absolute beginners? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are tips for absolute beginners? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي من دي من النصائح التسع لتدريس المبتدئين المطلقين؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Write a lot on the board while you keep explaining", "Be animated, with mime and sound effects", "Learn a bit of their L1", "Review constantly, starting every class with a review"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: beginners cannot multi-task. Do one thing at a time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المبتدئين مبيعرفوش يعملوا حاجتين. حاجة واحدة في كل مرة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: not all learning has to be serious.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: مش كل التعلم لازم يبقى جاد.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they see you as a partner in learning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بيشوفوك شريك في التعلم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: you are their textbook and study guide.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: إنت كتابهم ودليل مذاكرتهم.</div>"], "l": "tefl-11"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-B:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In 'The boy, who we met yesterday, is very nice', why can 'that' not replace 'who'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why can't we use 'that' here?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه مينفعش نستخدم <span class=\"en\">that</span> بدل <span class=\"en\">who</span> في <span class=\"en\">The boy, who we met yesterday, is very nice</span>؟</div>", "o": ["'That' always needs a comma", "'That' is only for objects", "'Who' is always required after a comma-free noun", "The commas make it a non-defining clause that only adds extra information"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: 'that' can be used for people in defining clauses.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">that</span> ممكن للأشخاص في الجمل المحدِّدة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: we already know which boy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: إحنا عارفين أنهي ولد.</div>"], "l": "tefl-12"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-B:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The first verb in a sentence can decide the form of the second verb, for example 'enjoy' + gerund and 'decide' + to-infinitive.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الفعل الأول في الجملة ممكن يحدد شكل الفعل التاني، زي <span class=\"en\">enjoy</span> + <span class=\"en\">gerund</span> و<span class=\"en\">decide</span> + <span class=\"en\">to-infinitive</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Modal verbs are always followed by the infinitive without 'to'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الأفعال الناقصة دايمًا بعدها المصدر من غير <span class=\"en\">to</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-12"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In 'She sings rock and roll tunes', is 'sings' transitive or intransitive?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Is 'sings' transitive here?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">She sings rock and roll tunes</span>، هل <span class=\"en\">sings</span> متعدٍّ أم لازم؟</div>", "o": ["It is an adverb", "Intransitive, because 'sings' never takes an object", "Transitive, because the tunes receive the action", "Transitive, because it has an indirect object"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فعل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: many verbs can be both.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: أفعال كتير ممكن تكون الاتنين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the same verb can be intransitive in 'She sings every day'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: نفس الفعل ممكن يبقى لازم في <span class=\"en\">She sings every day</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: there is no indirect object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيش مفعول غير مباشر.</div>"], "l": "tefl-13"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-B:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A subordinate clause is also called an independent clause.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الجملة الفرعية اسمها كمان جملة مستقلة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. The subordinate clause is the dependent clause. The main clause is the independent one.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. الفرعية هي التابعة، والرئيسية هي المستقلة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">The subordinate clause is the dependent clause. The main clause is the independent one.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الفرعية هي التابعة، والرئيسية هي المستقلة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-14"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m02-test-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m02-test-C:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why is 'I have been to Brazil in 2006' wrong?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why can we not say this?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه الجملة <span class=\"en\">I have been to Brazil in 2006</span> غلط؟</div>", "o": ["Because Brazil needs 'the'", "Because the present perfect is only for the future", "The present perfect cannot be used with a specific time like 2006", "Because 'been' is not a past participle"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no article is needed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيش حاجة اسمها كده.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it talks about the past.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بتتكلم عن الماضي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: a specific time needs the past simple: I went to Brazil in 2006.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الوقت المحدد محتاج <span class=\"en\">past simple</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: been is the past participle of go in this use.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">been</span> هو الـ <span class=\"en\">past participle</span> هنا.</div>"], "l": "tefl-16"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-C:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How many tenses are in the full table, and how are they grouped?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How many tenses, and what groups?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كام زمن في الجدول الكامل وإزاي متقسمين؟</div>", "o": ["Twelve: six simple, three perfect, three continuous", "Sixteen: four of each type", "Twelve: three simple, three perfect, six continuous", "Nine: three simple, three perfect, three continuous"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the numbers are swapped.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الأرقام متبدلة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the right total.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العدد مش صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: as the unit says.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: زي ما الوحدة بتقول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: there are twelve.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فيه اتناشر.</div>"], "l": "tefl-17"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-C:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A teacher says 'never end a sentence with a preposition'. What kind of rule is that?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What kind of rule is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المدرس بيقول متنهيش الجملة بحرف جر. دي قاعدة إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Metalanguage: it is a word for a verb", "A timeline: it shows time", "Descriptive: it records how people speak", "Prescriptive: it says what is correct"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: metalanguage means words about language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">metalanguage</span> كلمات عن اللغة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a timeline is a board diagram.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">timeline</span> رسمة على السبورة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a descriptive view accepts 'Who do you want to speak to?'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الوصفي بيقبل الجملة دي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it makes a value judgment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتحكم إن ده صح أو غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-18"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-C:4", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of these are used with the present perfect simple? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the words used with the present perfect simple.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي كلمات بتتستخدم مع <span class=\"en\">present perfect simple</span>؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["yesterday", "since", "for", "already"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a specific time needs past simple.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: وقت محدد يعني <span class=\"en\">past simple</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: since I was at school.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: for three years.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-16"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-C:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is 'eliciting'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does elicit mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">elicit</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Correcting every error at once", "Drawing the answer out of students instead of telling them", "Giving homework", "Reading the rule aloud"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is not eliciting.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده مش <span class=\"en\">elicit</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: unrelated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مالوش علاقة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is telling.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده إنك تقول.</div>"], "l": "tefl-18"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-C:6", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which ideas help with teenagers? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the useful ideas for teenagers.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي أفكار بتفيد مع المراهقين؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Always use long grammar explanations", "Play to their interests like movies or soccer", "Use controlled competition in groups", "Avoid metalanguage"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it can lose them.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ممكن تفقدهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m02-test-C.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-D", "model": "D", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m02-test-D:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which tense is 'I was writing letters when you called'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which tense is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الجملة دي <span class=\"en\">I was writing letters when you called</span> أي زمن؟</div>", "o": ["Past continuous", "Past perfect", "Past simple", "Present perfect continuous"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: was + verb-ing, an action in progress and interrupted.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">was + verb-ing</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that needs had + past participle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده محتاج <span class=\"en\">had + past participle</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: past simple has no -ing form.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيهوش <span class=\"en\">-ing</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that needs have/has been.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده محتاج <span class=\"en\">have/has been</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-16"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-D:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is the correct negative of 'You played tennis'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Choose the correct negative.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة هي النفي الصح لـ <span class=\"en\">You played tennis</span>؟</div>", "o": ["You did not played tennis.", "You do not played tennis.", "You not played tennis.", "You did not play tennis."], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: after did not use the stem, not -ed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بعد <span class=\"en\">did not</span> نستخدم <span class=\"en\">stem</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: mixes present and past.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: خلط بين الحاضر والماضي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you need did not.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: محتاج <span class=\"en\">did not</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: did not + verb stem.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">did not + verb stem</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-17"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-D:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">When teaching 'going to' through the Maria situation, what should the teacher do after the class repeats the first sentence?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the next step?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في موقف ماريا لتدريس <span class=\"en\">going to</span>، المدرس يعمل إيه بعد ما الفصل يكرر؟</div>", "o": ["Give a written test", "Move straight to free writing", "Explain the rule using metalanguage like auxiliary verb", "Elicit more examples, drill them and check with concept questions"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too early.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بدري.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: practice comes first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: التدريب الأول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the unit says avoid metalanguage at this stage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الوحدة بتقول تجنب <span class=\"en\">metalanguage</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then practise with a gap-fill and pairs.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بعدين تمرين <span class=\"en\">gap-fill</span> وشغل في أزواج.</div>"], "l": "tefl-18"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-D:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Non-action verbs like know and like normally take the continuous form.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الأفعال <span class=\"en\">know</span> و<span class=\"en\">like</span> عادةً بتيجي في الـ <span class=\"en\">continuous</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. They take the simple form: I have known her since school.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. بتيجي <span class=\"en\">simple</span>: <span class=\"en\">I have known her</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">They take the simple form: I have known her since school.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بتيجي <span class=\"en\">simple</span>: <span class=\"en\">I have known her</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-16"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-D:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which approach is right for learners under about 8-9?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Best way for very young learners?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنسب طريقة للأطفال الأصغر من 8-9 سنين؟</div>", "o": ["Teach rules explicitly with metalanguage", "Drill isolated grammar tables", "Help them notice forms inside stories, songs and play", "Wait until they ask for plurals"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not appropriate at this age.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مناسب للسن ده.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: never teach grammar in isolation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: متدرسش القواعد معزولة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: grammar must come from meaningful contexts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: القواعد تطلع من سياق ليه معنى.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you select features and highlight them yourself.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: انت اللي بتختار وتبرز.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-test-D:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does a needs analysis find out?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is a needs analysis?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">needs analysis</span> بيعرف إيه؟</div>", "o": ["The learner's age only", "The learner's grade in the last exam", "What a learner needs English for and what to improve", "Which games the learner likes"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is about needs.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بتاع احتياجات.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش الهدف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: do it informally at the first meeting.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بشكل غير رسمي في أول لقاء.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is interests.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي اهتمامات.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m02-test-D.pdf"}], "tefl-m3": [{"id": "tefl-m03-test-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m03-test-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In PPP, what is the job of the presentation stage?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does the presentation stage do?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مهمة مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">presentation</span> في <span class=\"en\">PPP</span> إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Let students speak freely with no model", "Fill in gap-fill sheets", "Show the target language in context with a clear model", "Test students on grammar names"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is production.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده الـ <span class=\"en\">production</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is controlled practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده <span class=\"en\">controlled practice</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: through a dialogue, text or situation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: من خلال حوار أو نص أو موقف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim of presentation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش هدف المرحلة دي.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-A:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should a good lesson plan consider? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick everything a lesson plan should think about.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي خطة الدرس المفروض تراعيه؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Only the textbook page number", "The logical development of stages", "The overall objective", "Time management"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a plan is much more than a page number.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الخطة أكتر من رقم صفحة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In Test Teach Test, what is the first stage?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What comes first in TTT?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه أول مرحلة في <span class=\"en\">TTT</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Homework correction", "A long grammar explanation", "A final exam", "A light test using the target language"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a TTT stage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مرحلة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: teaching comes second.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الشرح تاني.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the last stage is a freer test.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: آخر مرحلة اختبار حر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it shows what students already know.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بيوضح اللي الطلاب يعرفوه.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is the correct order of the five stages of TBL?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the order of stages?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه ترتيب مراحل الـ <span class=\"en\">TBL</span> الخمسة؟</div>", "o": ["Assignment, reporting, planning, practice, analysis", "Planning, assignment, analysis, reporting, practice", "Practice, analysis, assignment, planning, reporting", "Assignment, planning, reporting, analysis, practice"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: planning comes before reporting.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">planning</span> قبل <span class=\"en\">reporting</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: swapped pairs.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: متبدلين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: practice comes last.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الـ <span class=\"en\">practice</span> في الآخر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A student studies English only to get a higher salary. Which motivation is this?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which type of motivation?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">طالب بيتعلم إنجليزي علشان مرتب أعلى. دي أي دافع؟</div>", "o": ["Intrinsic", "Extrinsic", "Autonomous", "Multi-directional"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: intrinsic is for enjoyment of learning itself.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الـ <span class=\"en\">intrinsic</span> للاستمتاع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: an external reward.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: مكافأة خارجية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not one of the two types.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش من النوعين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a type of learner motivation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش نوع.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-A:6", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are characteristics of a motivated learner? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the traits of a motivated learner.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي صفات للمتعلم المتحمس؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Takes on challenges with confidence", "Keeps making effort despite setbacks", "Stays patient when confused", "Gives up when progress is slow"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is not a motivated trait.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m03-test-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m03-test-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the second conditional lesson, what is the right order for the first presentation steps?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What comes first in the presentation?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه ترتيب خطوات الـ <span class=\"en\">presentation</span> في درس الـ <span class=\"en\">second conditional</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Drill, rule, written form, context, model sentence", "Written form, rule, model sentence, drill, context", "Rule, drill, context, model sentence, written form", "Context, model sentence, drill, written form, rule"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you need context first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: لازم السياق الأول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: context should come first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: السياق الأول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the rule comes last, not first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: القاعدة في الآخر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the order given in the unit.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الترتيب في الوحدة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-B:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In PPP, the practice stage should take most of the lesson time.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">PPP</span> مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">practice</span> تاخد معظم وقت الحصة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. The three stages should get roughly equal weight.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. المراحل التلاتة المفروض ياخدوا وقت متقارب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">The three stages should get roughly equal weight.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">المراحل التلاتة المفروض ياخدوا وقت متقارب.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-B:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why is the first test called 'diagnostic'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does diagnostic mean here?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه الاختبار الأول اسمه <span class=\"en\">diagnostic</span>؟</div>", "o": ["It gives marks to every student", "It finds gaps in what students know", "It replaces the lesson", "It compares students with each other"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is not for grades.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش للدرجات.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then you teach those gaps.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: وبعدين تعلم الفجوات.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the lesson follows.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الدرس بيجي بعده.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش الهدف.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-B:4", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are tips for a good task? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the tips for good tasks.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نصايح لمهمة كويسة؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["It suits the students' level", "The purpose is clearly stated", "It is interesting and motivating", "It must have only one right answer"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: tasks are open-ended.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المهام مفتوحة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should you do first with a new adult class to understand motivation?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">First step with a new class?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أول خطوة مع فصل كبار جديد لفهم دافعهم؟</div>", "o": ["Ignore reasons and start", "Tell them extrinsic motivation is better", "Ask why they decided to take the course", "Give a long grammar test"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you need to know them.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: لازم تعرفهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: research is not conclusive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: البحث مش حاسم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then you can encourage their drive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not about motivation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-B:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Regular formal assessment is a powerful motivator, but it should not carry too much stress.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">التقييم المنتظم محفز قوي لكن مينفعش يبقى فيه ضغط كبير.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Assessment must not be overused or stressful.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">متكثرش فيه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m03-test-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m03-test-C:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which answer correctly completes: 'What would you do if you ___ the lottery?'</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Choose the right verb form.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أكمل: <span class=\"en\">What would you do if you ___ the lottery?</span></div>", "o": ["win", "would win", "won", "will win"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the second conditional needs the past form.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: محتاج الماضي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: would goes in the result clause.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">would</span> في جملة النتيجة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the if-clause takes the past simple.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: جملة الشرط بتاخد <span class=\"en\">past simple</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is the first conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده الـ <span class=\"en\">first conditional</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-C:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the past continuous lesson, why does the teacher ask 'What was I doing just before being hit?'</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is this question for?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه المدرس بيسأل السؤال ده؟</div>", "o": ["It checks understanding of the action in progress", "It corrects an error", "It starts free practice", "It tests spelling"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the answer is crossing the road.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الإجابة <span class=\"en\">crossing the road</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no error is being corrected.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيش غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a check of understanding.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فحص فهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it checks meaning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بيفحص المعنى.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-C:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the Teach stage of the clothes lesson, what does the teacher do with students' sentences?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What happens in Teach?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">Teach</span> المدرس بيعمل إيه بجمل الطلاب؟</div>", "o": ["The teacher reads the grammar book aloud", "Students copy a table from the board", "Students write them on the board and the class corrects them together", "The teacher deletes them without comment"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the lesson is built on students' language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الدرس مبني على لغتهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not what the unit describes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش اللي الوحدة بتوصفه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: for example fixing 'he is wearing a trousers'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: زي تصحيح <span class=\"en\">he is wearing a trousers</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are the lesson material.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي مادة الدرس.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-C:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In Task-based Learning, who decides what language is studied?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Who decides the language?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">TBL</span> مين بيقرر اللغة اللي هتتدرس؟</div>", "o": ["The school inspector", "The teacher before the lesson", "The course book alone", "It comes from what happens as students do the task"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not mentioned.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not pre-decided in TBL.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش محددة مسبقًا.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: needs of students decide.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: احتياجات الطلاب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the teacher does not pre-determine it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المدرس مش بيحددها قبل كده.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-C:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity best personalises learning?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which one is personalised?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط شخصي أكتر؟</div>", "o": ["Read the rules aloud", "Fill in a single-answer gap-fill", "Copy the verb table", "What three questions would you ask David Beckham?"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not personal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not personal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not personal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it uses students' own interests.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-C:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A motivated student on Monday will always be motivated on Tuesday.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">طالب متحمس الإتنين هيفضل متحمس التلات.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Motivation does not last. Personal problems can change it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. الحماس مش دايم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Motivation does not last. Personal problems can change it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الحماس مش دايم.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m03-test-C.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-D", "model": "D", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m03-test-D:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity belongs to the production stage?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a production activity?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط من مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">production</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Drilling a model sentence", "Gap-fill on the second conditional", "Matching sentence halves", "A role-play in groups"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: presentation stage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مرحلة العرض.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: controlled practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">controlled practice</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: controlled practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">controlled practice</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: students use the language freely.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الطلاب بيستخدموا اللغة بحرية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-D:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which note about the production stage is correct?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is true about production?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي ملاحظة عن مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">production</span> صح؟</div>", "o": ["Tell them exactly which sentences to use", "Do not script what students say; give them time", "Stop them from using older language", "Keep it short so no one struggles"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it must be free.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: لازم تكون حرة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: thinking in another language takes longer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: التفكير في لغة تانية بياخد وقت.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they may use other language they know.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ممكن يستخدموا لغة تانية يعرفوها.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: time is needed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: محتاجين وقت.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-D:3", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are advantages of TTT? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the advantages of TTT.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مميزات للـ <span class=\"en\">TTT</span>؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Students use prior knowledge", "It mixes up the lesson format", "The whole lesson is planned perfectly in advance", "The lesson is tailored to their needs"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you cannot know what to teach until you test.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: متعرفش تعلم إيه قبل الاختبار.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-D:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is one weakness of PPP mentioned in the unit?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is a weakness of PPP?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه نقطة ضعف <span class=\"en\">PPP</span> في الوحدة؟</div>", "o": ["It is too short", "Students overuse the target structure so it sounds unnatural", "It never uses a context", "It has no practice stage"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a weakness named.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it presents in context.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بيقدم في سياق.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has controlled practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فيه <span class=\"en\">controlled practice</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-D:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which exercise is open-ended?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which exercise is open-ended?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي تمرين مفتوح؟</div>", "o": ["If I won 100,000 euros, I would...", "Choose a or b", "Write the past of go", "Spell the word aloud"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: many possible answers.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: إجابات كتير.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: one right answer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: one right answer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: one right answer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-test-D:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Adult learners get annoyed by too many fun activities. What helps?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What should the teacher do?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الكبار بيضايقهم الألعاب الكتير. المدرس يعمل إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Remove all games for ever", "Give extra homework", "Tell them the purpose of the game before it starts", "Make them perform at the front"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: variety is useful.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the solution.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then they accept the fun element.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this can intimidate.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m03-test-D.pdf"}], "tefl-m4": [{"id": "tefl-m04-test-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m04-test-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of these is a personal aim?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a personal aim?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مما يلي هدف شخصي؟</div>", "o": ["Practise past simple forms", "Introduce food vocabulary", "Role-play booking a hotel", "Reduce my teacher talking time"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a learning aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: هدف تعليمي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a learning aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: هدف تعليمي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a procedure.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده <span class=\"en\">procedure</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it is about the teacher's own development.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: عن تطوير المدرس نفسه.</div>"], "l": "tefl-24"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is an essential component of every lesson plan?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which component is essential?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مكوّن أساسي في كل خطة؟</div>", "o": ["Timing", "Homework", "Main aim", "Reserve tasks"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: optional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: اختياري.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: optional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: اختياري.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: along with learners' info, stage aims, procedures and materials.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: optional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: اختياري.</div>"], "l": "tefl-25"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which method does the unit suggest for a grammar point like the past simple, and which for a listening lesson?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which format for which aim?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنهي أسلوب مناسب لإيه؟</div>", "o": ["Always use the same format", "Choose the format before the aim", "The aim decides the structure, for example PPP for a grammar point", "Let students pick the format"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: structure changes with the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: first decide the objectives.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the format follows the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الشكل بيتبع الهدف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not mentioned.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-26"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which test measures how well students understood one unit?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which test is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي اختبار بيقيس فهم وحدة واحدة؟</div>", "o": ["Progress test", "Proficiency test", "End-of-course test", "Placement chat"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it measures overall ability.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it covers the whole programme.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not one of the four types.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which factor matters most when choosing a course book for students preparing for IELTS?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which book fits?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنسب كتاب لطلاب بيحضروا للـ <span class=\"en\">IELTS</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A general English book only", "A grammar book for teachers only", "A children's story book", "A book that trains the techniques of that exam"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not enough.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not for the exam.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: wrong level and goal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: general English is usually not enough.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-28"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-A:6", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are supplementary materials? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the supplementary materials.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مواد إضافية؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Games", "Graded readers", "Dictionaries", "Videos or DVDs"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reference materials.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مراجع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-29"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m04-test-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m04-test-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which statement is a procedure, not an aim?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which one is a procedure?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة <span class=\"en\">procedure</span> مش هدف؟</div>", "o": ["Students prepare and present a hotel reception role-play", "To raise awareness of intonation", "To become familiar with expressions for booking", "To give students the chance to produce language"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it says what students do (the how).</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتقول الطلاب بيعملوا إيه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: هدف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is an aim (the why).</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده هدف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: هدف.</div>"], "l": "tefl-24"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-B:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'What will I do if students finish early?' Which component answers this?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which component?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مكوّن بيجاوب السؤال ده؟</div>", "o": ["Reserve tasks", "Anticipated problems", "Assumed knowledge", "Interaction"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: extra activities ready for fast finishers.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is what might go wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is what students already know.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is how students are grouped.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-25"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-B:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In a reading lesson, what is the aim of pre-teaching essential vocabulary?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why pre-teach vocabulary?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه بنعلم المفردات قبل القراءة؟</div>", "o": ["To prepare students for the reading task", "To test students' spelling", "To give freer practice", "To check detailed comprehension"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it focuses on useful language for the task.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that comes later.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is later in the plan.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-26"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-B:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which task is subjective?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which task is subjective?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مهمة ذاتية (subjective)؟</div>", "o": ["Matching", "An interview", "True/false", "A cloze test"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: objective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: judged, so trickier to mark.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: objective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: usually one right answer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A pre-intermediate class: how should you teach the present continuous?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How much to teach?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تدرّس الـ <span class=\"en\">present continuous</span> لمستوى متوسط أول؟</div>", "o": ["Skip it", "Teach every use at once", "Use a book for advanced teachers", "Keep it simple and leave the future use for later"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they need the basics.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this can confuse.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too detailed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: extra uses may confuse them.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-28"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-B:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is a disadvantage of supplementary materials?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a disadvantage?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي عيب؟</div>", "o": ["They add extra practice", "They fit students' needs", "Preparation time could be long", "They add variety"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an advantage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an advantage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: also level and fit problems.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an advantage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-29"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m04-test-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m04-test-C:1", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The aim is the 'why' of an activity and the procedure is the 'how'.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الهدف هو الـ 'ليه' والإجراء هو الـ 'إزاي'.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Aim = purpose. Procedure = what you do.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الهدف = السبب. الإجراء = اللي بتعمله.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-24"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-C:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Assumed knowledge asks: what is the purpose of the lesson?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">assumed knowledge</span> بيسأل: إيه هدف الدرس؟</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. It asks what students already know. The purpose is the main aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. بيسأل الطلاب يعرفوا إيه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">It asks what students already know. The purpose is the main aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بيسأل الطلاب يعرفوا إيه.</div>"], "l": "tefl-25"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-C:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which stage should come first in a listening lesson about a restaurant?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What comes first?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مرحلة الأول؟</div>", "o": ["Drill pronunciation", "Elicit restaurant vocabulary", "Role-play the dialogue", "Listen to a conversation between a waitress and a customer"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: later.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: after listening in this plan.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: later.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: listening comes before eliciting, drilling and role-play.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-26"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-C:4", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are advantages of portfolio assessment? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the advantages of portfolios.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مميزات للـ <span class=\"en\">portfolio</span>؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Encourages reflective learning", "Shows various samples of work", "Easy to turn into one grade", "Fair for different learning styles"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is a disadvantage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده عيب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-C:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Grammar in Use by Murphy is a good start for teachers who feel unsure about grammar.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كتاب <span class=\"en\">Grammar in Use</span> بداية كويسة للمدرسين.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">It is written for non-native speakers, so it is simpler.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">مكتوب لغير الناطقين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-28"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-C:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why might puppets be a poor choice?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">When are puppets a problem?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إمتى العرايس ممكن تبقى اختيار سيئ؟</div>", "o": ["They relieve boredom", "They may seem patronising to adult business learners", "They need electricity", "They help children memorise"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a benefit.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: choose aids that suit the students.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a plus.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-29"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m04-test-C.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-D", "model": "D", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m04-test-D:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The teacher says 'You will hear three conversations. Tell me what the people are talking about.' What is the stage aim?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the stage aim?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه هدف المرحلة؟</div>", "o": ["Peer assessment", "Listening for detail", "Self-correction", "Listening for gist"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not about checking others.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: detail asks for specific facts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: التفاصيل بتسأل عن حقايق.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no correction yet.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: general understanding.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: فهم عام.</div>"], "l": "tefl-24"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-D:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does 'interaction' in a lesson plan describe?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is interaction?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">interaction</span> في الخطة؟</div>", "o": ["Whether students work in pairs, groups or with the teacher", "How to deal with problems", "How long each stage takes", "Which book to use"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: potential solutions.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: timing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: materials.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-25"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-D:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Experienced teachers may write a plan on scrap paper, but still think about the same elements.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مدرس خبير ممكن يكتب خطته على ورقة صغيرة لكنه يفكر في نفس العناصر.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The thinking is automatic for them.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">التفكير تلقائي عندهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-26"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-D:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Informal assessment can show students' real ability better than a formal exam.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">التقييم غير الرسمي ممكن يوضح القدرة الحقيقية أكتر من الامتحان الرسمي.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Nervous students may underperform in formal tests.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الطالب المتوتر ممكن يتأثر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-D:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What can a teacher's book add?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does a good teacher's book give?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي كتاب المدرس ممكن يضيفه؟</div>", "o": ["A free class", "Worksheets, tests and step-by-step guidance", "A grammar exam for teachers", "Only student answers"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not related.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: some even explain answers.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not its aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: some give more.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-28"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-test-D:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do many teachers make their own materials?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why make your own?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه المدرسين بيعملوا مواد بنفسهم؟</div>", "o": ["Making materials is always quicker", "Commercial books are always free", "Commercial materials are often too generic for specific learners", "Schools forbid books"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it takes time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they fit the context less.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-30"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m04-test-D.pdf"}], "tefl-m5": [{"id": "tefl-m05-test-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m05-test-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the main aim of Communicative Language Teaching?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is CLT's main aim?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الهدف الأساسي من <span class=\"en\">CLT</span>؟</div>", "o": ["To remove all errors", "To memorise dialogues perfectly", "To teach only speaking", "To link language to context and build communicative competence"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that was the old accuracy focus.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: mechanical memorising faded away.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: CLT covers all skills.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: learners use English to do real things.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-A:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which statements characterise CLT? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the true statements about CLT.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي عبارات عن <span class=\"en\">CLT</span> صح؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Accuracy and fluency are both goals", "Classroom activities should involve real communication", "Grammar is not important at all", "People learn a language through communicating in it"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: grammar still matters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: القواعد لسه مهمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which one is a communicative activity?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is communicative?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط تواصلي؟</div>", "o": ["A prepared speech", "A scripted role-play", "Describing a picture to the teacher who can see it", "One student describes a picture and the partner draws it"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no exchange.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: nothing new is exchanged.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no information is missing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: information changes hands.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which gap-fill is communicative?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which gap-fill is communicative?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي <span class=\"en\">gap-fill</span> تواصلي؟</div>", "o": ["Complete 'If the photos ___ good (be)'", "Fill in the verb in brackets", "Copy the missing words from the board", "Pairs with the same text but different missing information"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: accuracy work.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not an exchange.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no real exchange.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they ask questions to complete it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the difference between an error and a mistake?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Error vs mistake?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الفرق بين <span class=\"en\">error</span> و<span class=\"en\">mistake</span>؟</div>", "o": ["An error: the student does not know the form. A mistake: a slip even though they know it", "They are exactly the same", "A mistake is more serious than an error", "An error is spoken. A mistake is written"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they differ.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not defined that way.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: both can be spoken or written.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A student says 'I go to the cinema last week.' Which is recasting?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a recast?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي رد هو <span class=\"en\">recast</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Ah, you went to the cinema, that is nice.", "Which tense?", "Wrong! Say it again.", "Last week you GO to the cinema?"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: correct form, no attention drawn.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a prompt for self-correction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: direct correction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: stress on the error, not a recast.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m05-test-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m05-test-B:1", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In CLT, the teacher becomes a facilitator rather than a regulator.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">CLT</span> المدرس بيبقى <span class=\"en\">facilitator</span> مش <span class=\"en\">regulator</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The teacher enables learning instead of controlling it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بيسهّل التعلم بدل ما يتحكم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-B:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which method did CLT move away from in the seventies and eighties?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What did CLT replace?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">اتحرك الـ <span class=\"en\">CLT</span> بعيد عن أي أسلوب؟</div>", "o": ["Task-based learning", "Audio-lingual drilling", "Role-play", "Graded readers"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a newer approach.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: drilling grammar.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: still used in CLT.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a method.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-B:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A communicative activity needs an information exchange.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">النشاط التواصلي لازم يكون فيه تبادل معلومات.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Without it, speech is meaningless.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">من غيره الكلام ملوش معنى.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-B:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the spot-the-difference task, how do pairs find differences?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How do they find them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي الأزواج بيلاقوا الفروق؟</div>", "o": ["By writing a story", "By describing their pictures to each other", "By asking the teacher", "By swapping pictures"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the task.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: not by looking.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not communicative.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that defeats the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'I've been knowing her for three years' is what kind of error?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What kind of error?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">نوع الخطأ؟</div>", "o": ["Grammar: incorrect tense", "Pronunciation", "Appropriacy", "Lexis"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: know is a non-action verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: nothing about sound.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a register problem.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the word is right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-B:6", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are ways to encourage self-correction? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the self-correction methods.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي طرق بتشجع التصحيح الذاتي؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Repeating the sentence up to the error", "Ignoring the student", "Facial expressions like raised eyebrows", "Finger correction"], "a": [0, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is not correction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m05-test-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m05-test-C:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the danger of reducing teacher talk too much?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What can go wrong?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الخطر لو قللنا كلام المدرس أكتر من اللازم؟</div>", "o": ["The lesson can seem to have no direction", "Pair work becomes impossible", "Grammar disappears for good", "Students stop speaking"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it becomes just a series of speaking activities.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the stated danger.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they speak more.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-C:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the difference between strong and weak CLT?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Strong vs weak CLT?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الفرق بين الـ <span class=\"en\">strong CLT</span> و<span class=\"en\">weak CLT</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Strong: only reading. Weak: only writing", "Strong is for adults. Weak is for children", "Strong: very little explicit teaching. Weak: varied teaching with a bias to speaking and listening", "Strong uses a lot of grammar rules. Weak uses none"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the difference.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not about age.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reversed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-C:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should the teacher do during a problem-based discussion?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Teacher's role?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">دور المدرس أثناء المناقشة؟</div>", "o": ["Give the solution first", "Leave the room", "Facilitate and monitor, without dictating the solution", "Correct every sentence"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: students solve it themselves.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you monitor and support.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: interrupts the discussion.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-C:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which skills do problem-based discussions practise?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What do they practise?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">بيمرّنوا على إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Silent reading", "Spelling lists", "Giving opinions, agreeing, disagreeing and compromising", "Copying dictation"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-C:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In a fluency activity, you should interrupt every error right away.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في نشاط طلاقة قاطع كل غلطة فورًا.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Interrupting hinders fluency. Use delayed correction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. المقاطعة بتأثر. استخدم تصحيح مؤجل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Interrupting hinders fluency. Use delayed correction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">المقاطعة بتأثر. استخدم تصحيح مؤجل.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-C:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">For low-level students you should correct every error, including things they have not studied yet.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مع المستوى الأقل صحح كل الأخطاء حتى اللي لسه ما اتعلموهاش.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Do not overwhelm them. Focus on the target language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. متثقلش عليهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Do not overwhelm them. Focus on the target language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">متثقلش عليهم.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m05-test-C.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-D", "model": "D", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m05-test-D:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which task focuses on fluency?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which task is fluency?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مهمة بتركز على الطلاقة؟</div>", "o": ["Practising language out of context", "Memorising a dialogue word for word", "A tourist role-play that aims to achieve communication", "Completing sentences with the right verb form"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: accuracy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: accuracy and memory.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: accuracy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-D:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">CLT cares more about completing the task through communication than about accurate grammar form.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">CLT</span> بيهتم بإنجاز المهمة بالتواصل أكتر من دقة الشكل.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The emphasis is on communication.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">التركيز على التواصل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-D:3", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are common communicative activities? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the communicative activities.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي أنشطة تواصلية؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Information gap-fills", "Board games with questions", "Copying verb tables", "Spot the difference"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no communication.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-D:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Describing a picture to someone who is already looking at it is authentic communication.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">وصف صورة لشخص بيبص عليها فعلاً تواصل حقيقي.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. This happens only in classrooms.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. ده بيحصل في الفصل بس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">This happens only in classrooms.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">ده بيحصل في الفصل بس.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-D:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why make delayed correction anonymous?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why anonymous?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نخلي التصحيح المؤجل مجهول؟</div>", "o": ["To save board space", "To hide the teacher's mistakes", "So nobody feels embarrassed, and everyone benefits", "Because it is always shorter"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: others may make the same error.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-test-D:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Can you do me a pleasure?' should be 'favour'. What error is it?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What type?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نوع غلط؟</div>", "o": ["Word stress", "Spelling only", "Verb tense", "Lexis: the wrong word"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is not about stress.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a meaning problem.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: tense is fine.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: and it may sound vulgar.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m05-test-D.pdf"}], "tefl-m6": [{"id": "tefl-m06-test-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m06-test-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is 'lexis'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does lexis mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">lexis</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Only single words", "Words, single or grouped, that have a specific meaning", "Only idioms", "The rules of grammar"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: groups of words count too.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المجموعات كمان.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: house, find out, head in the clouds.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: idioms are one kind.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الـ <span class=\"en\">idioms</span> نوع واحد.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not grammar.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-34"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is phonological awareness?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">phonological awareness</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Knowing the phonemic chart", "The ability to focus on the sounds of the language", "Matching letters to sounds in reading", "Pronouncing sounds clearly"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the definition.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: words are made of sounds of different sizes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is phonemic awareness.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده <span class=\"en\">phonemic awareness</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is pronunciation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده <span class=\"en\">pronunciation</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-35"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does phonemic awareness aim for?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the aim?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">هدف الـ <span class=\"en\">phonemic awareness</span> إيه؟</div>", "o": ["To speak without an accent", "To see the link between letters and the sounds they represent", "To learn word stress", "To memorise a dictionary"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is pronunciation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: this is decoding.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: different topic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-36"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-A:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Teachers should aim for perfect pronunciation in a communicative class.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المدرس لازم يستهدف نطق مثالي في الفصل التواصلي.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Aim for intelligibility and confidence.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. الهدف الوضوح والثقة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Aim for intelligibility and confidence.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الهدف الوضوح والثقة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-37"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is intonation?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">intonation</span>؟</div>", "o": ["The speed of reading only", "The number of words", "The spelling of sounds", "The movement of the voice level: the tune of speech"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-39"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-A:6", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are functions of language? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the functions.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي دول وظائف للغة؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Past perfect", "Refusing", "Apologising", "Inviting"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a tense, not a function.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده زمن.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-40"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m06-test-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m06-test-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which word is a compound noun?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a compound noun?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي كلمة <span class=\"en\">compound noun</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Unsafe", "Eyewitness", "Readable", "Quickly"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: prefix + word.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">prefix</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: eye + witness, one new meaning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: word + suffix.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">suffix</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: word + suffix.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-34"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-B:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In 'cat', what are the onset and the rime?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Onset and rime of cat?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">onset</span> والـ <span class=\"en\">rime</span> في <span class=\"en\">cat</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Onset: a. Rime: ct", "Onset: at. Rime: c", "Onset: ca. Rime: t", "Onset: c. Rime: at"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not how it divides.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: swapped.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the onset is the consonant before the vowel.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: onset is the initial consonant, rime the rest.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-35"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-B:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The final goal of phonemic awareness work is understanding meaning, not the awareness itself.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الهدف النهائي فهم المعنى مش الـ <span class=\"en\">phonemic awareness</span> نفسه.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">It supports reading comprehension.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بيدعم الفهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-36"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-B:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does a phonemic symbol represent?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does a symbol show?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الرمز الصوتي بيمثل إيه؟</div>", "o": ["One letter of the alphabet", "One phoneme, a single unit of sound", "One whole word", "One syllable"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it shows sound, not spelling.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: independent of normal spelling.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a syllable may have several phonemes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-37"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'You will make a lot of progress.' vs 'You will progress a lot.' How does stress change the word?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does stress change?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي بيغيره الضغط؟</div>", "o": ["Noun: PROgress. Verb: proGRESS", "Only the tense", "Only the spelling", "Nothing, only volume"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: stress changes the part of speech.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not tense.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: spelling stays the same.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it changes the word class.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-38"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-B:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is an 'exponent'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is an exponent?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">exponent</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A kind of stress", "A grammar rule", "An expression used to carry out a function", "A homophone"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not that.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not that.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: I would like to introduce you to... has the function of introducing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not that.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-40"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m06-test-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m06-test-C:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'On the ball' means alert and capable. What kind of expression is this?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What type of expression?</div><div class=\"q-ar\"><span class=\"en\">On the ball</span> معناها متيقظ وكفء. نوعها إيه؟</div>", "o": ["A suffix", "A homophone", "An idiom", "A compound noun"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a word part.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: homophones sound the same.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: meaning cannot be known from the single words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a noun.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-34"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-C:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity is phoneme deletion?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is deletion?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط <span class=\"en\">phoneme deletion</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Clap the syllables in elephant", "Say /b/ /i/ /g/ and make big", "Take /s/ away from smile to get mile", "Change /g/ in bug to /n/ to get bun"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: syllable segmenting.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: blending.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: substitution.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">substitution</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-35"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-C:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why can English decoding be tricky?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why is it tricky?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه فك الشفرة في الإنجليزي صعب؟</div>", "o": ["Each letter has exactly one sound", "Sound-symbol links have many exceptions, like c in cat and city", "English has no vowels", "English has no spelling"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is not true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: unlike Spanish's one-to-one match.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has many.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it does.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-36"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-C:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is a diphthong?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a diphthong?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">diphthong</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A vowel sound that glides from one vowel to another in one syllable", "A consonant blocked by the lips", "A letter with no sound", "A word with two stresses"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: like the /ei/ in say.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a consonant.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: one word has one main stress.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-37"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-C:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Inexperienced teachers often speak too slowly and too emphatically.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المدرس عديم الخبرة غالبًا بيتكلم ببطء وتأكيد زيادة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Students then imitate and cannot follow natural speech.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الطلاب بيقلدوه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-39"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-C:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Let's go to the park today' has which function?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which function?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الجملة دي وظيفتها إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Making a suggestion", "Clarifying", "Greeting", "Requesting politely"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no clarifying.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no greeting.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a request.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-40"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m06-test-C.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-D", "model": "D", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m06-test-D:1", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which pairs show a prefix giving the opposite meaning? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick correct prefix + word pairs.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي أزواج بتعطي عكس المعنى بالبادئة؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["sane → unsane", "legal → illegal", "responsible → irresponsible", "patient → impatient"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the word is insane.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الكلمة <span class=\"en\">insane</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: il- before l.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: ir- before r.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: im- before p.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-34"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-D:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How many syllables does 'elephant' have?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How many syllables?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كام مقطع في <span class=\"en\">elephant</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Two: ele-phant", "Four: e-le-pha-nt", "Three: el-e-phant", "One"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: three.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: three.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: three.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-35"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-D:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should you never ask learners to do?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is forbidden?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي متطلبوش من الطلاب؟</div>", "o": ["Read a short text", "Decode a familiar word", "Decode a word whose meaning they do not know", "Blend sounds into words"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: allowed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is recommended.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: focus on known words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: allowed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-36"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-D:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the realistic goal of pronunciation teaching?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the goal?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الهدف الواقعي لتدريس النطق؟</div>", "o": ["Intelligibility: being easy to understand", "Speaking as fast as possible", "Silent reading", "A perfect native accent"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: not perfection.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: speed is not the goal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: unrelated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: who decides what is perfect?</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-37"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-D:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">One word has only one main stress.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الكلمة الواحدة ليها ضغط أساسي واحد بس.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Two main stresses would be two words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">ضغطين يعني كلمتين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-38"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-test-D:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which order of greetings is from least to most formal?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Order by formality?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">رتب التحيات من الأقل لأكتر رسمية.</div>", "o": ["Hello. / Yo, what's up? / Good afternoon. / Hi!", "How do you do? / Hello. / Hi! / Yo, what's up?", "Good afternoon. / Hi! / How do you do? / Hello.", "Yo, what's up? / Hi! / Hello. / Good afternoon. / How do you do?"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: mixed up.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is reversed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: mixed up.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: register rises step by step.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-40"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m06-test-D.pdf"}]};window.MODPRACT={"tefl-m1": [{"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do English articles cause huge difficulty for some students?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why are articles hard?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه أدوات التعريف في الإنجليزي بتسبب صعوبة كبيرة لبعض الطلاب؟</div>", "o": ["Articles are only used in writing", "Their first language has no articles at all", "Articles change with the person", "English has more than 26 letters"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the concept is new to them.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الفكرة جديدة عليهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: articles do not change with the person.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الأدوات مبتتغيرش مع الشخص.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: English has 26 basic letters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الإنجليزي 26 حرف أساسي.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:2", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following are examples of English words borrowed from other languages in the lesson? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which words came from other languages? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي من الكلمات دي اتاخدت من لغات تانية حسب الدرس؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["cargo (from Spanish)", "clothes (from Latin)", "barbecue (from Spanish)", "alligator (from Spanish)"], "a": [0, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: from cargar, to load.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: من <span class=\"en\">cargar</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: 'clothes' is given as a hard sound, not a borrowed word.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">clothes</span> مذكورة كصوت صعب مش كلمة مستعارة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: from barbacoa.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: من <span class=\"en\">barbacoa</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: from el lagarto.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: من <span class=\"en\">el lagarto</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do Spanish learners often say 'Espain'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why 'Espain'?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه المتعلمين الإسبان بيقولوا <span class=\"en\">Espain</span>؟</div>", "o": ["They confuse v and b", "They use a tone", "They drop the final consonant", "Spanish words do not start with s before another consonant, so they add an e"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a different problem.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مشكلة تانية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: Spanish is not tonal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الإسباني مش نغمي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is typical of Chinese learners.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده أقرب للصينيين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:4", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Spanish has many cognates with English, which is an advantage that Chinese learners do not have.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false: Spanish learners have many cognates.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الإسباني فيه كلمات كتير مشتركة مع الإنجليزي وده ميزة الصينيين مش عندهم.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Cognates share a history and look and mean alike. Chinese has very few.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الكلمات المشتركة ليها تاريخ مشترك وشكل ومعنى متقاربين. الصيني فيه قليل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is an L2?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is L2?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه هي الـ <span class=\"en\">L2</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A teaching method", "A school level", "The second or foreign language a person is learning", "A person's first language"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a method.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش طريقة تدريس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a level.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مستوى.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is L1.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي الـ <span class=\"en\">L1</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-03"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:6", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of these describe a child learning her L1? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How do children learn L1? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي من دي بيوصف طفل بيتعلم لغته الأولى؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Immersed in the language from birth", "Not often corrected", "Motivated to communicate her needs", "Receives little attention"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: she learns by playing and experimenting.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتتعلم باللعب والتجريب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: she gets a lot of attention and praise.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بتاخد اهتمام ومديح كتير.</div>"], "l": "tefl-03"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which influence on L2 learning is shown when a learner expects a formal, strict teacher?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which influence is this?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي عامل مؤثر على تعلم الـ <span class=\"en\">L2</span> بيظهر لما المتعلم يتوقع مدرّس رسمي وصارم؟</div>", "o": ["Gender", "Appropriate topics", "Prior learning", "Intellect"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: gender is a separate influence.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الجنس عامل منفصل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is about what topics are acceptable.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده عن المواضيع المقبولة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: learners bring expectations from their home school system.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المتعلمين بيجيبوا توقعات من نظامهم المدرسي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is about expectation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده عن التوقع.</div>"], "l": "tefl-04"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:8", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In an idea-focused style, disagreeing with someone's idea is seen as a personal attack.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في الأسلوب المركّز على الفكرة، الخلاف مع فكرة حد بيتشاف كهجوم شخصي.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true: The idea and the person are separate. It is the person-focused style where disagreement feels like an attack.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح: الفكرة والشخص منفصلين. الأسلوب المركّز على الشخص هو اللي الخلاف فيه بيتحس كهجوم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">The idea and the person are separate. It is the person-focused style where disagreement feels like an attack.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الفكرة والشخص منفصلين. الأسلوب المركّز على الشخص هو اللي الخلاف فيه بيتحس كهجوم.</div>"], "l": "tefl-04"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the lesson, what does the Code of Practice say about a teacher using her authority?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does the Code say about authority?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي بيقوله الميثاق عن استخدام المدرّس لسلطته؟</div>", "o": ["Authority is only for the head teacher", "Never abuse a position of authority for financial, political or personal gain", "Authority should be hidden from students", "Use authority to collect private lessons"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this breaks the Code.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده بيخالف الميثاق.</div>"], "l": "tefl-05"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:10", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which actions fit 'Care and Protection'? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which actions protect students? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي تصرفات بتناسب «الرعاية والحماية»؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Making reasonable efforts to protect students from harm", "Being generous with praise", "Following the school's student protection policies", "Embarrassing students who give wrong answers"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the Code forbids embarrassment and harassment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الميثاق بيمنع الإحراج والتحرش.</div>"], "l": "tefl-05"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which trait is shown when a teacher lets a fluent speaking task continue and corrects mistakes afterwards?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which trait is this?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي صفة بتظهر لما المدرّس يسيب مهمة كلام سلسة تكمل ويصحح الأخطاء بعدين؟</div>", "o": ["Setting low expectations", "Choosing appropriate moments for correcting learners' language", "Ignoring assessment", "Increasing teacher talking time"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not related.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مالهاش علاقة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it is trait 9.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: دي الصفة 9.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: fair assessment is trait 13.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: التقييم العادل الصفة 13.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the lesson says to reduce it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الدرس بيقول قلله.</div>"], "l": "tefl-06"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:12", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Setting high but achievable expectations can raise students' achievement.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">وضع توقعات عالية لكن ممكنة ممكن يرفع تحصيل الطلاب.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Students generally give as much as the teacher expects.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الطلاب غالبًا بيدّوا بقدر ما المدرّس بيتوقع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-06"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">You want students to lead the lesson themselves. Which layout fits?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which layout is for student-led lessons?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">عايز الطلاب يقودوا الحصة بنفسهم. أي ترتيب مناسب؟</div>", "o": ["A circle, with the teacher inside", "Islands", "Straight rows", "Corners"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: everyone is on an equal level.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الكل في مستوى متساوي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: islands suit group work.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الجزر للشغل الجماعي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: rows do not support student leading.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الصفوف مبتدعمش قيادة الطلاب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: corners suit opposing teams.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الأركان للفرق المتنافسة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-07"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:14", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which rule is an INEFFECTIVE classroom rule, according to the lesson?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which rule does not work well?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي قاعدة غير فعّالة في الفصل حسب الدرس؟</div>", "o": ["Only speak English in the classroom", "Be on time for class", "Switch off your mobile phone", "Silence in the classroom"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is effective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي فعّالة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is effective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي فعّالة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is effective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي فعّالة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it blocks communication practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتمنع ممارسة التواصل.</div>"], "l": "tefl-07"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:15", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why are icebreakers also useful as warmers?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why use icebreakers as warmers?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه أنشطة كسر الجليد مفيدة كمان كـ <span class=\"en\">warmers</span>؟</div>", "o": ["They are only for substitutes", "They replace the lesson", "They wake the class up and introduce the topic of the lesson", "They test last week's grammar"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are also for new courses and normal lessons.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: كمان للكورسات الجديدة والحصص العادية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they support it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بتدعمه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: use a variety to match the task.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: استخدم تنوع يناسب المهمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not their purpose.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش غرضها.</div>"], "l": "tefl-08"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:16", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In Introduce Your Partner, students practise third person verb forms such as 'he lives'.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">Introduce Your Partner</span>، الطلاب بيتدربوا على الأفعال مع الغائب زي <span class=\"en\">he lives</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Introducing a partner instead of yourself practises the 's' form.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">تقديم الزميل بدل النفس بيدرّب على صيغة <span class=\"en\">s</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-08"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:17", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following is a good example of descriptive, not evaluative, feedback?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which comment is descriptive?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي تعليق ده مثال كويس لتغذية راجعة وصفية مش تقييمية؟</div>", "o": ["That was poor.", "The way you stayed calm and focused helped everyone cope.", "You handled that well.", "You were brilliant."], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: evaluative and not specific.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: تقييمي وغير محدد.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it says what you saw and its effect.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بيقول اللي اتشاف وتأثيره.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is evaluative.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده تقييمي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too general and evaluative.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: عام وتقييمي.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:18", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following are among the seven rules of constructive feedback? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are rules of feedback? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي من دي من القواعد السبع للتغذية الراجعة البنّاءة؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Demand an immediate change", "Be specific", "Own the feedback with 'I think' or 'I feel'", "Start with the positive"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: rule 7 says to leave the recipient with a choice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: القاعدة 7 بتقول سيب للمتلقي اختيار.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: rule 2.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: القاعدة 2.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: rule 6.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: القاعدة 6.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: rule 1.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: القاعدة 1.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-A:19", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A learner is shy about criticising classmates in peer feedback. What does the lesson suggest?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How can a shy learner give peer feedback?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">متعلم خجول من انتقاد زملائه في الـ <span class=\"en\">peer feedback</span>. إيه اللي بيقترحه الدرس؟</div>", "o": ["Let the strongest student criticise everyone", "Give a handout that asks for notes on certain areas, like structure or fluency", "Ask for only general comments", "Skip peer feedback for the whole course"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not suggested.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مقترح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: specific areas are easier than general comments.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: المجالات المحددة أسهل من التعليقات العامة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: general comments are harder for shy students.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: التعليقات العامة أصعب للخجولين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is useful for all learners.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيد لكل المتعلمين.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m01-practice-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of these is the biggest problem English presents for learners?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the biggest problem?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أكبر مشكلة في الإنجليزي للمتعلمين؟</div>", "o": ["It has hundreds of tones", "Sound and spelling often do not match", "It has many letter marks", "It has a very long alphabet"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: English is not tonal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: and the odd words are very common.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has none.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has 26 letters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which pair look the same but sound different?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which pair?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي زوج شكلهم واحد ونطقهم مختلف؟</div>", "o": ["ate and eight", "hear and here", "read (now) and read (past)", "know and no"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: sound the same, spelled differently.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: sound the same.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: sound the same.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">English has a fixed SVO word order.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الإنجليزي ترتيبه ثابت <span class=\"en\">SVO</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Subject, verb, object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">فاعل، فعل، مفعول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-01"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do Spanish learners confuse 'ship' and 'sheep'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why do they confuse them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه متعلمين الإسبانية بيلخبطوا؟</div>", "o": ["Spanish has no vowels", "Spanish has fewer vowel sounds and vowel length does not matter", "Spanish uses a different alphabet", "Spanish has tones"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has vowels.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it uses Latin letters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it does not.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is a typical Chinese-speaker error?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which error is typical?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي غلط شائع؟</div>", "o": ["Using gendered articles", "Placing adjectives after nouns", "Saying 'He sad' by dropping the verb to be", "Adding an e before s in Espain"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: Spanish has gender.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: typical for Spanish.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: Chinese does not need it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: typical for Spanish speakers.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-02"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which describes an L1 child learner?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which fits an L1 child?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي وصف يناسب طفل بيتعلم لغته الأولى؟</div>", "o": ["Immersed, motivated, praised and rarely corrected", "Learns only in class", "Little attention from adults", "Limited exposure and often corrected"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not typical.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not typical.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that describes the L2 student.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-03"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is an example of extrinsic motivation?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is extrinsic?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مثال على الدافع الخارجي؟</div>", "o": ["Liking grammar puzzles", "Feeling proud of progress", "Learning English to get a new job", "Enjoying the language for its own sake"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: intrinsic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: more intrinsic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: an external reward.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: intrinsic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-04"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is circumlocution in speaking?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">circumlocution</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Talking around a word you do not know", "Translating word for word", "Repeating the word louder", "Staying silent"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-04"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the aim of reducing TTT?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why reduce TTT?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نقلل <span class=\"en\">TTT</span>؟</div>", "o": ["To avoid planning", "To end class early", "To maximise student talking time (STT)", "To save the teacher's voice"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-06"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is an Instruction Check Question (ICQ)?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is an ICQ?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">ICQ</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A question about the weather", "A simple question that checks students understood the task", "A homework reminder", "A grammar quiz"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: for example 'How much time?'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-07"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:11", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Icebreakers can be used on the first day and as warmers.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">icebreakers</span> تنفع في أول يوم وكـ <span class=\"en\">warmers</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">They relax students and build rapport.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بتريّح الطلاب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-08"}, {"id": "tefl-m01-practice-B:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is constructive feedback?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">constructive feedback</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Only praise", "A grade", "Feedback that helps the student build and improve", "Negative feedback with nothing to build on"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it can include guidance.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is destructive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-09"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m01-practice-B.pdf"}], "tefl-m2": [{"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does the CEFR stand for?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does CEFR mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه معنى <span class=\"en\">CEFR</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Central English Foundation Research", "Cambridge English First Revision", "Common English Fluency Rating", "Common European Framework of Reference"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: Cambridge exams are a different system.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: امتحانات كامبريدج نظام تاني.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-10"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which CEFR band includes B1 and B2?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which band has B1 and B2?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مستوى عام في <span class=\"en\">CEFR</span> فيه <span class=\"en\">B1</span> و<span class=\"en\">B2</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Proficient User", "Independent User", "Beginner User", "Basic User"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: C1 and C2.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">C1</span> و<span class=\"en\">C2</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: A is Basic, B is Independent, C is Proficient.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a CEFR band.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مستوى <span class=\"en\">CEFR</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: A1 and A2.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">A1</span> و<span class=\"en\">A2</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-10"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:3", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which belong to linguistic competence in the CEFR? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is linguistic competence? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي من دي ضمن الكفاءة اللغوية في <span class=\"en\">CEFR</span>؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Syntax", "Phonology", "Lexis", "Rules of address and politeness"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: how words form sentences.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: relations among speech sounds.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: words and phrases.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: كلمات وعبارات.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is socio-linguistic competence.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي الكفاءة الاجتماعية اللغوية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-10"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why can false beginners be hard to teach?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why are false beginners tricky?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه الـ <span class=\"en\">false beginners</span> ممكن يبقوا صعبين في التدريس؟</div>", "o": ["Surface knowledge can hide bad habits, and they may think they already know the material", "They have too much motivation", "They know no English", "They refuse all pair work"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: their motivation can suffer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دافعيتهم ممكن تقل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is an absolute beginner.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده المبتدئ المطلق.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>"], "l": "tefl-11"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following is a trick the lesson gives for learning a student's name when you forget it?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How can you learn a forgotten name?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مما يلي حيلة بيذكرها الدرس لتعلم اسم طالب نسيته؟</div>", "o": ["Describe the student ('a boy with a red shirt near the window') and let the class say the name", "Call him 'student' all term", "Ask him to write his name 10 times", "Skip all questions to him"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: personal connection matters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العلاقة الشخصية مهمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not suggested.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مقترح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a solution.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش حل.</div>"], "l": "tefl-11"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">At elementary level, every pronoun except I has two negative contractions with 'be': for example 'you're not' and 'you aren't'.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في المستوى الأساسي، كل ضمير ماعدا <span class=\"en\">I</span> ليه صيغتين للنفي مع <span class=\"en\">be</span>: زي <span class=\"en\">you're not</span> و<span class=\"en\">you aren't</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">'I am not' has only 'I'm not'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\"><span class=\"en\">I am not</span> ليها <span class=\"en\">I'm not</span> بس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-11"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which modal expresses that something is 'forbidden'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which modal means forbidden?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي فعل ناقص بيعبّر عن إن حاجة ممنوعة؟</div>", "o": ["Don't have to", "Must not", "Should", "May"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not necessary, not forbidden.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش ضروري مش ممنوع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: must not and cannot mean forbidden.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: advisable.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مستحب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is possible.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ممكن.</div>"], "l": "tefl-12"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How many relative pronouns are listed, and which relative adverbs?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What are the relative pronouns and adverbs?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كام ضمير وصل مذكور، وإيه ظروف الوصل؟</div>", "o": ["Five pronouns and no adverbs", "Five pronouns (who, which, whom, that, whose) and three adverbs (where, when, why)", "Three pronouns and five adverbs", "Seven pronouns and two adverbs"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: there are three adverbs.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فيه ثلاث ظروف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reversed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: معكوس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-12"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is a correct passive of 'Somebody has stolen my wallet'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the passive of this sentence?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة هي المبني للمجهول الصحيح لـ <span class=\"en\">Somebody has stolen my wallet</span>؟</div>", "o": ["My wallet was stolen by has.", "My wallet is steal.", "My wallet has stolen.", "My wallet has been stolen."], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no passive form.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيش صيغة مبني للمجهول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: be in the same tense (present perfect) plus the past participle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">be</span> بنفس الزمن + التصريف الثالث.</div>"], "l": "tefl-12"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which part of speech is 'bravery' in 'His incredible bravery was rewarded'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What part of speech is 'bravery'?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه نوع الكلمة <span class=\"en\">bravery</span> في <span class=\"en\">His incredible bravery was rewarded</span>؟</div>", "o": ["An adverb", "A verb", "An adjective", "A noun (abstract)"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it does not describe a verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش بتصف فعل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: 'incredible' is the adjective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">incredible</span> هي الصفة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it names a concept.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتسمّي مفهوم.</div>"], "l": "tefl-13"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:11", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">An adverb can modify a noun.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الظرف ممكن يعدّل اسم.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Adjectives modify nouns. Adverbs modify verbs, adjectives or other adverbs.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. الصفات بتعدّل الأسماء، والظروف بتعدّل الأفعال والصفات والظروف التانية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Adjectives modify nouns. Adverbs modify verbs, adjectives or other adverbs.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الصفات بتعدّل الأسماء، والظروف بتعدّل الأفعال والصفات والظروف التانية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-13"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which word is NOT an adjective among the words built from 'satisfy'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is not an adjective?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي كلمة مش صفة من الكلمات المشتقة من <span class=\"en\">satisfy</span>؟</div>", "o": ["satisfying", "satisfactory", "satisfactorily", "satisfied"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an adjective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: صفة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an adjective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: صفة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it is an adverb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: ظرف.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: an adjective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: صفة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-13"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How many phonemes are there in standard modern English?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How many phonemes does English have?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كام فونيم في الإنجليزي الحديث القياسي؟</div>", "o": ["44", "52", "12", "26"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: fairly evenly divided between vowels and consonants.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: 26 is the number of letters.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: 26 عدد الحروف.</div>"], "l": "tefl-14"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:14", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How can you find the number of clauses in a sentence quickly?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How do you count clauses?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تعرف عدد الجمل الفرعية والرئيسية بسرعة؟</div>", "o": ["Count the main verbs: each main verb is one clause", "Count the capital letters", "Count the commas", "Count the nouns"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-14"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:15", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which of the following are verb phrases? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are verb phrases? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي من دي عبارات فعلية؟ اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["may have been planning", "can see", "would have sent", "a pile of books"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the main verb is last.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الفعل الرئيسي في الآخر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: auxiliary + main verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is a noun phrase.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي عبارة اسمية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-14"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:16", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is compound?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which sentence is compound?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة مركبة (compound)؟</div>", "o": ["I do not like eating strawberries but I love eating carrots.", "Made in France.", "When the noisy vehicle passed, the mighty lion roared.", "The dog barked."], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: two main clauses joined by 'but'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: جملتين رئيسيتين بـ <span class=\"en\">but</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a sentence.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش جملة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: complex.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: معقدة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: simple.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بسيطة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-15"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-A:17", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">An independent clause is another name for the main clause.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">independent clause</span> اسم تاني للجملة الرئيسية.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The dependent clause is the subordinate one.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">التابعة هي الفرعية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-15"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m02-practice-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence shows a fixed future arrangement with a specific time?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which one is a fixed plan?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة بتعبر عن ترتيب مستقبلي مؤكد بوقت محدد؟</div>", "o": ["In 2050 we will all be driving electric cars.", "She is going to have a baby!", "He is seeing Jim on Sunday afternoon.", "I think it will rain tomorrow."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: future continuous, an action in progress then.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">future continuous</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: going to shows intention or prediction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">going to</span> للنية أو التوقع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: present continuous for fixed plans.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">present continuous</span> للخطط المؤكدة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a prediction with will.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: توقع بـ <span class=\"en\">will</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-16"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'I had been waiting for four hours.' Which tense is this and how is it formed?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Name the tense and its form.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الجملة دي زمنها إيه وبتتكون إزاي؟</div>", "o": ["Future perfect continuous: will have been + verb-ing", "Present perfect continuous: have been + verb-ing", "Past perfect: had + past participle", "Past perfect continuous: had been + verb-ing"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that starts with will.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده بيبدأ بـ <span class=\"en\">will</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that starts with have/has.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده بيبدأ بـ <span class=\"en\">have/has</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no been + -ing there.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مفيهوش <span class=\"en\">been + -ing</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-17"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">There is one set format for a timeline.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">فيه شكل واحد ثابت للـ <span class=\"en\">timeline</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Any clear format works. Just explain it first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. أي شكل واضح يمشي. اشرحه الأول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Any clear format works. Just explain it first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">أي شكل واضح يمشي. اشرحه الأول.</div>"], "l": "tefl-18"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:4", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which statements about 'shall' are correct? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the true statements about shall.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي عبارات عن <span class=\"en\">shall</span> صح؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["It is more common in British English", "It is more common in American English", "The negative can be shan't", "It can make the future like will"], "a": [0, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is more British.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده أكتر في البريطاني.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-17"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A child says 'My books is wet.' What corrective feedback fits the unit?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How should the teacher respond?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">طفل قال <span class=\"en\">My books is wet</span>. إزاي المدرس يرد؟</div>", "o": ["Ignore the mistake completely", "Books is plural, so the verb must agree.", "Oh, your books are wet? Why are they wet?", "That is wrong. Say it again."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: feedback is essential for all ages.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الـ <span class=\"en\">feedback</span> ضروري.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: metalanguage for a young learner.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">metalanguage</span> لطفل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: model the correct form naturally.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بتقول الشكل الصح بشكل طبيعي.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this does not model the form.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش بتوري الشكل الصح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is recycling?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does recycling mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">recycling</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Teaching a new word each day", "Throwing away old worksheets", "Meeting and using a word several times until it is remembered", "Copying a text five times"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: recycling repeats old words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: بتكرر كلمات قديمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the meaning here.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش المعنى هنا.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: frequency is key.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: التكرار هو المفتاح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not meaningful use.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش استخدام بمعنى.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does the 'A' in CASSIAL stand for in Aitken's approach? Pick the pair that is correct.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What do the letters mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه معنى الحروف في <span class=\"en\">CASSIAL</span>؟ اختار الزوج الصح.</div>", "o": ["Analyse and Auxiliary materials", "Assess and Answer", "Ask and Argue", "Apply and Assign"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the two A's are Analyse and Auxiliary materials.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">Analyse</span> و<span class=\"en\">Auxiliary materials</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not in the list.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش في القايمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not in the list.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش في القايمة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not in the list.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش في القايمة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-16"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:8", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">There is little difference between 'will be' and 'be going to' in the future continuous.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مفيش فرق كبير بين <span class=\"en\">will be</span> و<span class=\"en\">be going to</span> في الـ <span class=\"en\">future continuous</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The unit says either form usually works.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الوحدة بتقول إن الاتنين شغالين غالبًا.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-17"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is in the future perfect?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which one is future perfect?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة في الـ <span class=\"en\">future perfect</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Dad will have cooked dinner by the time we get back.", "Dad will cook dinner tonight.", "Dad is cooking dinner now.", "Dad had cooked dinner before we left."], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: will have + past participle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: <span class=\"en\">will have + past participle</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: future simple.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">future simple</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: present continuous.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">present continuous</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: past perfect.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">past perfect</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-17"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In 'The ugggawagga kicked a thnollanugga', why is 'ugggawagga' a noun and the subject?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why a noun subject?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه <span class=\"en\">ugggawagga</span> اسم وفاعل؟</div>", "o": ["Because it is a long word", "It comes after 'The' and does the kicking", "Because it ends in -a", "Because we know its dictionary meaning"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: length does not matter.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الطول ملوش دعوة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: setting and function show it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: الموقع والوظيفة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: endings alone do not decide.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: النهاية لوحدها متحددش.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has no meaning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مالوش معنى.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:11", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">With adults, use lots of drills and games all the time.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مع الكبار استخدم تدريبات وألعاب كتير طول الوقت.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Use them sparingly. Many adults see drilling as childish.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. استخدمها بحذر. كتير من الكبار شايفينها طفولية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Use them sparingly. Many adults see drilling as childish.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">استخدمها بحذر. كتير من الكبار شايفينها طفولية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}, {"id": "tefl-m02-practice-B:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which grouping is correct for age groups in the unit?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which age groups?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي تقسيم للأعمار صح في الوحدة؟</div>", "o": ["Babies, children, adults", "Primary, secondary, university", "Younger young learners, older young learners, teenagers, adults", "Beginners, intermediate, advanced"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the unit's groups.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش تقسيم الوحدة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: those are school stages.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي مراحل دراسة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: those are levels.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي مستويات.</div>"], "l": "tefl-19"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m02-practice-B.pdf"}], "tefl-m3": [{"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the 'used to' lesson, what does the teacher draw to highlight the meaning?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does the teacher draw?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المدرس بيرسم إيه لتوضيح المعنى؟</div>", "o": ["A grammar table of all tenses", "A map of the classroom", "A timeline with several crosses in a past period", "A drawing of a face and a thought bubble"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not mentioned.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not related.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مالوش علاقة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it shows a regular past habit.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بيوضح عادة ماضية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is the going to lesson.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده درس <span class=\"en\">going to</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the last stage of the traditional plan?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which stage comes last?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه آخر مرحلة في الخطة التقليدية؟</div>", "o": ["Consolidation and error correction", "Build context", "Model sentence", "Restricted practice"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: errors are highlighted without singling out students.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: بدون تحديد طالب بعينه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is the first stage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي أول مرحلة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: stage two.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المرحلة التانية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it comes before freer practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: قبل <span class=\"en\">freer practice</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">TTT can work with lower-level classes if the first exercise is graded.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">TTT</span> ينفع مع المستويات الأقل لو التمرين الأول مدرّج.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Grading means adjusting difficulty so students are not overwhelmed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">التدريج يعني تظبط الصعوبة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which method is the final TTT test most like?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which stage is it similar to?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الاختبار الأخير في <span class=\"en\">TTT</span> شبه أي مرحلة؟</div>", "o": ["PPP presentation", "PPP production", "PPP controlled practice", "A grammar quiz on tenses"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that introduces the language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: دي بتقدم اللغة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: freer practice with the language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: ممارسة حرة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the TTT final test is free.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: الاختبار الأخير حر.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a quiz.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش كويز.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In TBL, the task should be open-ended and free, not tightly controlled.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">TBL</span> المهمة لازم تكون مفتوحة وحرة مش متحكم فيها.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The aim is autonomy and real language use.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الهدف استقلالية واستخدام حقيقي للغة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">During the analysis stage, what does the teacher do?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What happens in analysis?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي بيحصل في مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">analysis</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Evaluates the task and highlights useful language", "Students perform the role-play", "Students vote for the best ending", "Gives out the instructions"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: this is where language study happens.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: هنا بتتدرس اللغة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reporting or the task itself.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: <span class=\"en\">reporting</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the analysis stage.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مرحلة التحليل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is assignment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: ده <span class=\"en\">assignment</span>.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:7", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">PPP, TTT and TBL are the only three lesson planning styles.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\"><span class=\"en\">PPP</span> و<span class=\"en\">TTT</span> و<span class=\"en\">TBL</span> هم بس تلات أنماط للتخطيط.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. There are many more styles. Try them and see what suits you.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. فيه أنماط أكتر. جرب واختار المناسب.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">There are many more styles. Try them and see what suits you.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">فيه أنماط أكتر. جرب واختار المناسب.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do TBL lessons feel less teacher-centred than PPP?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why less teacher-centred?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه حصص <span class=\"en\">TBL</span> أقل تمركزًا حول المدرس؟</div>", "o": ["Students choose the exam", "There is no feedback", "The teacher leaves the room", "Students spend more time speaking to complete the task"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not mentioned.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش مذكور.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reporting and analysis give feedback.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: فيه <span class=\"en\">feedback</span>.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the teacher guides and monitors.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: المدرس بيوجه.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the controlled practice stage, why is 'would win' wrong in 'What would you do if you ___ the lottery?'</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why is 'would win' wrong?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه <span class=\"en\">would win</span> غلط؟</div>", "o": ["Would is never used in English", "The verb win has no past form", "The sentence needs the present perfect", "The if-clause already needs the past simple, and would belongs in the result clause"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is used in the result clause.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is won.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-20"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity fits the first Test stage for a class learning to describe people?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is a good first test?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنسب اختبار أول؟</div>", "o": ["Pairs describe people in a picture while the teacher monitors", "A grammar exam on all tenses", "A long reading text", "A dictation of the rules"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: a light diagnostic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too demanding.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a quick test.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not diagnostic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-21"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:11", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In TBL the reporting stage is when students present their task results.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في <span class=\"en\">TBL</span> مرحلة الـ <span class=\"en\">reporting</span> الطلاب بيعرضوا نتايج المهمة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Results are reported orally or in writing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بيعرضوها شفهيًا.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the paper boat lesson, why can't student A show the object?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why no showing or gesturing?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه ممنوع يوري الشيء؟</div>", "o": ["Because paper is expensive", "So the instructions must be put into words", "To make the task shorter", "To test spelling"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: language is needed to complete the task.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-22"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why tell adult learners the purpose of a game before it starts?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why explain the purpose?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نشرح غرض اللعبة قبل ما تبدأ؟</div>", "o": ["It makes the game longer", "It removes the fun", "They accept the fun element when they see the goal", "Adults dislike all games"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not always.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}, {"id": "tefl-m03-practice-A:14", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Research shows motivation is strongly related to achievement in language learning.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الأبحاث بتقول الحماس مرتبط بقوة بالإنجاز.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">It matters in everything you do with learners.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">مهم في كل حاجة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-23"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m03-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m4": [{"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:1", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are types of aim in the TKT? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the three types of aim.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي أنواع أهداف في <span class=\"en\">TKT</span>؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Homework aims", "Subsidiary aims", "Main aim", "Personal aims"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a TKT aim type.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: مش نوع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-24"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is NOT a procedure?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is not a procedure?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أيهم مش <span class=\"en\">procedure</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Feedback answers", "The teacher photocopies and cuts up the statements", "Students check answers in pairs", "Students work in pairs to complete a task"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a procedure.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: this is preparation before the lesson.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح: تحضير قبل الدرس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a procedure.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a procedure.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-26"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Do you want to go to the park?' is made from 'to want go Do the you park to?'. What task is it?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which task type?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نوع مهمة؟</div>", "o": ["Summary writing", "Cloze test", "Re-ordering jumbled sentences", "Sentence transformation"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not summary.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that has blank words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: tests grammar, cohesion and collocation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that keeps the meaning with new structure.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is best when choosing assessment?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the best practice?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أفضل ممارسة؟</div>", "o": ["Use only interviews", "Use a mixture of formal and informal tasks", "Use only multiple choice", "Never assess"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too subjective and slow.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: all forms have pros and cons.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it misses productive skills.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: assessment is necessary.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why can reading EFL articles help you?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why read EFL articles?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نقرا مقالات <span class=\"en\">EFL</span>؟</div>", "o": ["They replace lesson plans", "They explain learners' difficulties, often from mother tongue interference", "They give free tests", "They teach the alphabet"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they do not.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not their purpose.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not their purpose.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-28"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">You should always find a video to introduce every lesson.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">لازم تلاقي فيديو تبدأ بيه كل درس.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Do not get carried away. Use extra material to add fun.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. متبالغش.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Do not get carried away. Use extra material to add fun.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">متبالغش.</div>"], "l": "tefl-29"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should you do before a listening lesson with a CD player?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What should you do?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">تعمل إيه قبل حصة سمع؟</div>", "o": ["Skip the listening", "Wait to see in class", "Check the equipment works", "Ask students to bring one"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the answer.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: risky.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: faulty equipment ruins the plan.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: your job.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-29"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:8", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are benefits of teacher-made materials? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the benefits.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي فوايد للمواد اللي المدرس بيعملها؟</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["They fit individual learners", "They fit the local context", "They can include today's events", "They never need planning"], "a": [0, 1, 2], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you still need guidelines.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-30"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:9", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">When you design materials, first link them to what learners already know.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">لما تصمم مواد اربطها الأول باللي الطلاب يعرفوه.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Otherwise they need much extra input.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">وإلا محتاجين شرح كتير.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-30"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which guideline is about your own abilities?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which guideline?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي إرشاد عن قدراتك؟</div>", "o": ["Fit the syllabus goals", "Consider your skill base and ask others for help", "Search for resources", "Meet your learners' needs"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is about the syllabus.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is about resources.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is about learners.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-30"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which statement is a subsidiary aim for phonology?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which aim is for phonology?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي هدف فرعي للنطق؟</div>", "o": ["To consolidate travel lexis", "To revise modal verbs", "To focus on intonation", "To give controlled practice"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: vocabulary.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: grammar.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: speaking.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-24"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'What are the activities for each stage?' relates to which component?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which component?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مكوّن؟</div>", "o": ["Procedures", "Reserve tasks", "Homework", "Timing"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: how long.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-25"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which tests overall language ability and gives a certificate?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which test?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي اختبار؟</div>", "o": ["A homework quiz", "A progress test", "A portfolio", "An external exam such as IELTS"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: informal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: one unit.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: continuous assessment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: a form of proficiency test.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-27"}, {"id": "tefl-m04-practice-A:14", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Five pensioners need English for a three-month coach trip in the USA. Which book fits?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which book?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنسب كتاب؟</div>", "o": ["A travel survival English book", "A children's course", "Business English", "IELTS preparation"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: match goals and deadline.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not their age.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not their goal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not their goal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-28"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m04-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m5": [{"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does 'communicative competence' mean?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">communicative competence</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Speaking without any errors", "Knowing every grammar rule", "Keeping communication going despite limitations", "Reading aloud well"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the definition.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the definition.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the definition.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is NOT a common CLT classroom pattern?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is not typical of CLT?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مش شائع في <span class=\"en\">CLT</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Pair work", "The teacher gives all language input and students only listen", "Group work", "Mingling activities"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: common.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: CLT is learner-centred.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: common.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: common.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A student says 'Why do I have to talk to my classmates all the time? I can do this in the pub.' Which problem does this show?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What problem is this?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الطالب بيشتكي من الكلام مع زمايله. دي مشكلة إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Too little structural input in a very strong CLT lesson", "Poor pronunciation", "Bad textbooks", "Too much grammar"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: weak CLT is more balanced.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not related.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the point.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the complaint is the opposite.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How can a board game be more communicative?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How to make a game more communicative?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تخلي لعبة اللوحة تواصلية أكتر؟</div>", "o": ["Remove the cards", "Use cards that make students answer and also ask others", "Use only the teacher's questions", "Let students play silently"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they give language prompts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: students should ask too.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no talking.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In the discussion routine, why mix the groups after the first discussion?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why re-form groups?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه بنغير المجموعات؟</div>", "o": ["To stop the discussion", "Students explain and compare their agreements with new partners", "To give marks", "To reduce the time to zero"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it continues.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then the whole class feeds back.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they get 10 minutes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why is correction less needed in a skills lesson aimed at fluency?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why little correction?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه تصحيح أقل في درس طلاقة؟</div>", "o": ["Because teachers cannot hear errors", "Because errors never matter", "Because students are perfect", "Jumping in can obstruct the main goal of fluid speaking"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you note them down.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they matter later.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they still need to improve.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: choose the right moment.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What three questions does research on correction focus on?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What three areas?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">تلات أسئلة عن التصحيح؟</div>", "o": ["Which book, which test, which room", "What, when and how to correct", "Speed, volume and tone", "Who, where and why to teach"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the three areas.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the three areas.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the three areas.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why go back later to a corrected error?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why review after on-the-spot correction?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نرجع للغلطة بعد التصحيح؟</div>", "o": ["Students may not have absorbed it and may repeat it", "To finish the lesson early", "To skip homework", "To punish the student"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: recall with questions helps.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not related.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: never the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which one is an accuracy-focused task?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is accuracy?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مهمة بتركز على الدقة؟</div>", "o": ["A mingling activity", "A tourist role-play", "A group discussion", "Completing sentences with the right verb form"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: fluency.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: fluency.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: fluency.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: language out of context.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:10", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Memorising dialogues mechanically is the heart of CLT.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">حفظ الحوارات ميكانيكيًا هو قلب <span class=\"en\">CLT</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. That is what faded away.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. ده اللي اختفى.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">That is what faded away.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">ده اللي اختفى.</div>"], "l": "tefl-31"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is not a communicative activity?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is not communicative?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أيهم مش تواصلي؟</div>", "o": ["Split crossword", "Spot the difference", "Board games with questions", "Describing a picture to the teacher who can see it"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: communicative.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: communicative.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: communicative.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: no information changes hands.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-32"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">When correcting later, why note errors during the task?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why take notes?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نسجل الأخطاء؟</div>", "o": ["To stop the activity", "To mark each student's grade", "To discuss them afterwards or plan future work", "To avoid teaching"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}, {"id": "tefl-m05-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do finger corrections work?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does finger correction do?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">finger correction</span>؟</div>", "o": ["It replaces speaking", "Fingers count the errors", "Each finger stands for one word, so the problem word can be shown", "It is only for writing"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not that.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: also speaking.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-33"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m05-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m6": [{"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is a strong collocation?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which sounds natural?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي تعبير طبيعي؟</div>", "o": ["Quick food", "Drive well-ish", "Crack someone's heart", "Drive safely"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the natural form is fast food.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a common combination.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is break someone's heart.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: common together.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-34"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'There', 'their' and 'they're' are homophones.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الكلمات <span class=\"en\">there</span> و<span class=\"en\">their</span> و<span class=\"en\">they're</span> <span class=\"en\">homophones</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Same sound, different spelling and meaning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">نفس النطق وتهجئة ومعنى مختلفين.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-34"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Alliteration draws attention to the sounds at the beginning of words.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">alliteration</span> بتلفت الانتباه لأصوات بداية الكلمات.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Example: a big, bad bug bit the little beetle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">مثال.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-35"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:4", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which statements about phonemic awareness instruction are correct? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the correct points.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نقاط صح عن تدريس الـ <span class=\"en\">phonemic awareness</span>؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Spend most of the lesson on it", "Use chunks and patterns learners will meet again", "It should not replace comprehension", "Do it briskly and with purpose"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a step, not the goal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-36"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sound is /θ/ as in 'thin'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which word has /θ/?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي كلمة فيها صوت <span class=\"en\">/θ/</span>؟</div>", "o": ["thin", "alone", "these", "hat"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: /ə/ in the first syllable.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: /ð/.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: /æ/.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-37"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is stressed in a sentence?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which words are stressed?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي كلمات بتتشدد؟</div>", "o": ["Articles", "Content words like nouns and main verbs", "Pronouns", "Prepositions"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: structure words, unstressed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they carry meaning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: structure words, usually.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: structure words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-38"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In 'she came home late last night', which word usually has main stress?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which word has main stress?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنهي كلمة عليها الضغط الأساسي؟</div>", "o": ["she", "late", "came", "night"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: unstressed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the unit's example.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: secondary.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: secondary.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-38"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why is 'she' stressed in 'Lisa didn't do that, did she? Yes, she did.'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why stressed here?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه <span class=\"en\">she</span> متشددة هنا؟</div>", "o": ["The speaker stresses it for emphasis", "All pronouns are always stressed", "It is a content word", "It is the first word"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: any word can be stressed if important.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not always.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a structure word.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: position does not decide.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-38"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why do the stressed content words keep a regular beat?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why a constant beat?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه الكلمات المشددة بتحافظ على إيقاع ثابت؟</div>", "o": ["Stress does not exist in English", "Every word has equal length", "The time between stressed words is the same, so small words are said faster", "The teacher claps the beat"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it does.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-39"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'I like Italian art, and opera.' How does the comma change the meaning?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What changes?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه اللي بيتغير؟</div>", "o": ["Nothing at all", "The pause changes how the ideas are grouped", "The tense", "The vocabulary"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: pauses matter.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: pauses change meaning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not tense.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: same words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-39"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A student says 'Pass me that book, would you?' to the teacher. What is the problem?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is wrong?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">فين المشكلة؟</div>", "o": ["It is grammatical but too informal for the context", "It is a lexis error", "It has a grammar error", "It has a stress error"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it seems rude to a teacher.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the words exist.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: grammatically fine.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the issue is formality.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-40"}, {"id": "tefl-m06-practice-A:12", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The same expression can have different functions depending on context and intonation.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">نفس العبارة ممكن تكون ليها وظائف مختلفة حسب السياق والنغمة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">For example: Can I help you?</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">مثال.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-40"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m06-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m7": [{"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which pair contains only receptive skills?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which are receptive skills?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي زوج مهارات استقبالية؟</div>", "o": ["Speaking and writing", "Listening and reading", "Listening and speaking", "Reading and writing"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: productive skills.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: learners receive language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: speaking is productive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: writing is productive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">The four skills are separate and do not support each other.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">المهارات الأربعة منفصلة ومش بتدعم بعض.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. They grow together and support one another.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. بتنمو مع بعض.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">They grow together and support one another.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بتنمو مع بعض.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is a learning style?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does it mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">learning style</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A consistent way a person takes in, organises and recalls information", "A school rule about seating", "A kind of textbook", "A test score"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How does the unit treat learning-style research?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is its position?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">موقف الوحدة من أبحاث أساليب التعلم؟</div>", "o": ["Totally useless, ignore it", "Only for children", "Fully proven, apply to everyone", "The science is unproven, so use styles with care, especially with young people"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: still useful, especially for adults.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it works well with adults.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is unproven.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which learners start using new software at once and feel their way?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which Kolb type?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نوع في <span class=\"en\">Kolb</span> بيبدأ يستخدم البرنامج على طول؟</div>", "o": ["Theorists", "Pragmatists", "Activists", "Reflectors"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they read the manual first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they check help files often.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they use it, then think.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which Kolb type reads the manual first?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Who reads the manual?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مين بيقرا الدليل الأول؟</div>", "o": ["Pragmatists", "Activists", "Reflectors", "Theorists"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they try and use help.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they just start.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they try first, then think.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:7", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are the three VAK styles? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the VAK styles.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي أنواع <span class=\"en\">VAK</span>؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Theoretical", "Visual", "Kinesthetic", "Auditory"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is not VAK.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:8", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Everyone uses all three VAK modalities to some degree.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كل الناس بتستخدم الـ <span class=\"en\">VAK</span> التلاتة بدرجات.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">One may be preferred.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">واحد ممكن يكون المفضل.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity suits a visual learner?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which suits visual learners?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط يناسب المتعلم البصري؟</div>", "o": ["A field trip with hands-on tasks", "A mind-map", "Listening to a lecture only", "Memorising by repeating aloud"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: kinesthetic.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: ideas shown in a diagram.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: auditory.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: auditory.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A teacher builds all activities around one learning style. What does the unit advise?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is the advice?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">النصيحة؟</div>", "o": ["Keep activities varied for the whole person", "Ignore all learner differences", "Test every student formally", "Use only the preferred style"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: observe students closely.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not advised.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: keep variety.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-41"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why is a recording harder than real-life listening?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why harder?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه التسجيل أصعب من السمع في الحياة؟</div>", "o": ["There is no visual context to help you understand", "Recordings are always fast", "Students never practise", "Recordings have no words"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: you cannot see speakers or situation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not always.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they do.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which pre-listening task helps learners prepare?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which pre-listening task?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط قبل السمع مفيد؟</div>", "o": ["Marking a test straight away", "Giving the questions before they listen", "Playing the recording once without any task", "Asking 'So what did you hear?' after"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not preparation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they can focus on cues.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no preparation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too general.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which question type should come first while listening?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which come first?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي أسئلة الأول؟</div>", "o": ["Detail questions", "Grammar questions", "Gist questions", "Spelling questions"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: after gist.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then details.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not first.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:14", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'So, what did you hear?' is a good general question after listening.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">سؤال 'سمعت إيه؟' مناسب بعد السمع.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Use true/false or table completion to focus attention.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. استخدم صح/غلط أو جدول.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Use true/false or table completion to focus attention.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">استخدم صح/غلط أو جدول.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:15", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is jigsaw listening?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">jigsaw listening</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Students write exactly what they hear", "The teacher reads a story twice", "Students cut up a recording", "Students hear different parts, then combine information in pairs"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is dictation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:16", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">For low-level students a BBC interview can be used if...</div><div class=\"q-simple\">When can a hard recording be used?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إمتى ممكن نستخدم تسجيل صعب؟</div>", "o": ["Students read the script first only", "It never is", "It is slowed down five times", "The task is simple and graded"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the idea.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it can be.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the unit's solution.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: grade the task, not the recording.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}, {"id": "tefl-m07-practice-A:17", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which kinds of material should students listen to?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What mix should be used?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مزيج من المواد؟</div>", "o": ["Only graded material", "Only songs", "Both authentic and graded material", "Only authentic material"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it does not prepare for real language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too narrow.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it may overwhelm.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-42"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m07-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m8": [{"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is skimming?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is skimming?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">skimming</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Reading aloud", "Reading to find one specific fact", "Reading quickly to get the general idea", "Reading every word closely"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: scanning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reading for detail.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'What time does the last bus leave?' is a typical question for which skill?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which reading skill?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">السؤال ده لأي مهارة قراءة؟</div>", "o": ["Skimming", "Reading for detail", "Inferring", "Scanning"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is for the gist.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not every word is needed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the answer is stated.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: look for specific information.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:3", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In real life we usually read for detail all the time.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في الحياة بنقرا بالتفصيل طول الوقت.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. We do it only on certain occasions, like complex instructions.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. في مواقف معينة بس.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">We do it only on certain occasions, like complex instructions.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">في مواقف معينة بس.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should students do first with an unknown word?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Unknown word?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">لو كلمة مجهولة؟</div>", "o": ["Try to deduce its meaning from context", "Skip the whole text", "Translate every word", "Look it up at once"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: then check if needed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not helpful.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: slow.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the first step.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How can pictures and titles help before reading?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why look at them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نبص على الصور والعناوين؟</div>", "o": ["They replace reading", "They help students predict genre and content", "They test spelling", "They give the answers"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is extensive reading?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is extensive reading?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">extensive reading</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Reading only the title", "Short texts with tasks in class", "Longer texts read for pleasure, often outside class", "Reading a dictionary"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: intensive reading.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: graded readers help.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does 'inferring' mean in reading?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is inferring?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">inferring</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Finding a phone number", "Understanding the meaning behind the words, like attitude", "Reading every word", "Counting words"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: scanning.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: detail.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In a top-down reading lesson, which order is right?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which order?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الترتيب الصح؟</div>", "o": ["Lead-in, predict, pre-teach, skim, scan, detail, vocabulary, follow-on", "Vocabulary, detail, lead-in, skim", "Follow-on, predict, detail, skim", "Detail, scan, skim, lead-in"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: general to detail.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: mixed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: mixed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reversed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-43"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How much should you pre-teach before reading?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How much pre-teaching?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">كام نعلم قبل القراءة؟</div>", "o": ["Only the key words that block the general message", "Only grammar", "Nothing, ever", "All new vocabulary"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: avoid a teacher-centred lesson.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: sometimes key words help.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it takes over the lesson.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How can you keep a scanning task from turning into reading for detail?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How to keep scanning?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تخلي مهمة الـ <span class=\"en\">scanning</span> تفضل <span class=\"en\">scanning</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Ask for translation of the whole text", "Give no task", "Set a short time limit and a task needing only scanning", "Let students read as slowly as they like"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: detail.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no focus.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it becomes detail.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:11", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">You should concept check all the lexis even when visuals already make it clear.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">لازم تعمل <span class=\"en\">concept check</span> لكل الكلمات حتى لو الصور واضحة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Clear visuals often do not need concept checks.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. الصور الواضحة مش محتاجة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Clear visuals often do not need concept checks.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الصور الواضحة مش محتاجة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which helps save time in a one-hour lesson?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How to save time?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي توفر وقت؟</div>", "o": ["Copying the analysis from the board", "Adding more tasks", "A short lead-in, clear instructions and a handout", "A very long lead-in"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: wastes time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: wastes time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: wastes time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How many tasks before language focus does the unit suggest at most?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How many tasks?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أقصى عدد مهام قبل التركيز على اللغة؟</div>", "o": ["No more than two", "Ten", "Six", "None at all"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too many.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too many.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: students need to process the text.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:14", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why link the language back to the text?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why link to the text?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نربط اللغة بالنص؟</div>", "o": ["The text is the context that helps students understand the language", "To test spelling", "To make the lesson longer", "To avoid grammar"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}, {"id": "tefl-m08-practice-A:15", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is a cline?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is a cline?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">cline</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A visual scale showing degrees, like love to hate", "A type of dictionary", "A reading speed test", "A type of reader"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-44"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m08-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m9": [{"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which pair are productive skills?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which skills are productive?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي مهارات إنتاجية؟</div>", "o": ["Listening and writing", "Speaking and writing", "Listening and reading", "Reading and speaking"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: listening is receptive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: students produce language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: receptive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reading is receptive.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why is speaking in a foreign language especially hard?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why is it hard?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه الكلام بلغة أجنبية صعب؟</div>", "o": ["Because native speakers are always accurate", "Because speaking needs no vocabulary", "There is no time to organise thoughts, and students may lack words", "Because it is silent"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are not.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it does.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it happens in real time.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should you decide before a speaking lesson?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What to decide first?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">تقرر إيه قبل حصة الكلام؟</div>", "o": ["How many pages to read", "Which accent is best", "Whether the main aim is fluency, accuracy or both", "Which students will fail"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not relevant.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not relevant.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it shapes the activities and correction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not relevant.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity is controlled practice?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is controlled?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط تدريب موجّه؟</div>", "o": ["A scripted dialogue for polite requests", "Twenty questions with free choices", "A class discussion with role cards", "An open debate on a new topic"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: predictable language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: free practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: free practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: free practice.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Controlled practice helps build confidence and leads into freer practice.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">التدريب الموجّه بيبني الثقة ويقود للتدريب الحر.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Having the language in front of them is reassuring.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">اللغة قدامهم بتطمنهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which skill do free-practice speaking activities mainly build?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does free practice build?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">التدريب الحر بيبني إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Fluency, by maximising student talk time", "Handwriting", "Spelling", "Silent reading"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should the teacher do during a free speaking activity?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Teacher's role?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">دور المدرس؟</div>", "o": ["Step back, monitor and give thinking time", "Interrupt each mistake", "Give the answers", "Leave without listening"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: hinders fluency.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the role.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you monitor.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:8", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are part of speaking besides grammar and vocabulary? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the extra parts of speaking.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي حاجات بتدخل في الكلام غير القواعد؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Only spelling", "Stress and intonation", "Turn-taking", "Register"], "a": [1, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: speaking is not spelling.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-45"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What are minimal responses?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What are they?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">minimal responses</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Long speeches", "Short predictable phrases like 'Oh, I see' and 'Is that so?'", "Silent nods only", "Written answers"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are short.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: they help learners join in.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are phrases.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: spoken.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-46"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Do you mean...?' is which kind of phrase?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which check?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنهي نوع؟</div>", "o": ["A clarification check", "A comprehension check", "A minimal response", "A greeting"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: asking for more explanation.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that says you did not understand.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-46"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Sorry, I'm not sure I'm following you.' is which kind of phrase?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which check?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أنهي نوع؟</div>", "o": ["A script", "A comprehension check", "A clarification check", "A substitution drill"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: you say you have not understood.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that asks the speaker to explain.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-46"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:12", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Greetings, apologies and invitations often follow predictable scripts.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">التحيات والاعتذارات والدعوات غالبًا ليها نصوص متوقعة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Knowing scripts helps learners predict.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بتساعد على التوقع.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-46"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why should you reassure learners that misunderstanding is normal?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why reassure them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نطمنهم إن سوء الفهم طبيعي؟</div>", "o": ["So they never use phrases", "So they stop speaking", "They may be too shy to ask for clarification", "So you can skip feedback"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: opposite.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: opposite.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it happens at every level.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-46"}, {"id": "tefl-m09-practice-A:14", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How should speaking tasks be organised for shy students?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What works best?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الأنسب للطلاب الخجولين؟</div>", "o": ["Cold-calling every student", "Only written work", "Pairs or groups instead of performing in front of the class", "Always perform alone"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: stressful.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not speaking.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: lower the fear of being laughed at.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: scary.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-46"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m09-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m10": [{"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Who am I writing to?' is about which element of writing?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which element?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ده عن أنهي عنصر؟</div>", "o": ["Structure", "Content", "Register", "Purpose"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is the order of ideas.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is 'what do I need to say?'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: how formal or informal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is 'why am I writing?'.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'What will I talk about first, second, last?' is about...</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which element?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ده عن إيه؟</div>", "o": ["Structure", "Purpose", "Content", "Register"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reason.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: what to say.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: formality.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which task type gives learners samples of longer texts to follow?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which task type?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نوع كتابة بيدّي نماذج؟</div>", "o": ["Unguided writing", "Guided writing", "Controlled exercise", "Copying"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: little help.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: single words or phrases.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: copying characters or words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In process writing, who chooses what to write?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Who chooses?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">مين بيختار الموضوع؟</div>", "o": ["The teacher only, with no guidance", "The students, with teacher guidance through the process", "The school inspector", "A computer"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:5", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Writing needs the same mental processes as speaking.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الكتابة بنفس العمليات الذهنية للكلام.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Writing gives time to prepare, organise and check.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. الكتابة فيها وقت للتحضير والمراجعة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Writing gives time to prepare, organise and check.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">الكتابة فيها وقت للتحضير والمراجعة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is a correction code?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">correction code</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Symbols that show error types so students can self-correct", "A type of dictation", "A secret password", "A grade table"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:7", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should you reward when marking writing? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick what to reward.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">تكافئ إيه؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["Appropriate register", "Clear structure", "Only perfect handwriting", "Answering the question"], "a": [0, 1, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a main criterion.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why write a re-draft?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why re-draft?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نعيد كتابة المسودة؟</div>", "o": ["To skip proofreading", "To punish errors", "To make the text longer", "To improve the text with the whole task in mind"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: you still proofread.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: process matters as much as product.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-47"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is a writing strategy some learners use?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is a writing strategy?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي استراتيجية كتابة؟</div>", "o": ["Avoiding all writing", "Note-taking", "Reading the exam only", "Memorising dialogues only"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a strategy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: extra practice in writing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not a strategy.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not about writing.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-48"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is the difference between a substitution table and a matching table?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What differs?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الفرق؟</div>", "o": ["Substitution tables are for speaking", "Matching tables guarantee grammar", "Substitution tables guarantee correct grammar; matching tables need careful thought about meaning", "They are the same"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are written.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reversed.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they differ.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-48"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which activity is for beginners?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is for beginners?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي نشاط للمبتدئين؟</div>", "o": ["Writing a letter to a real person", "A group project with surveys", "Copying text", "Transforming a passage"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: harder.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: harder.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: harder.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-48"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:12", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Letting students read their writing to each other helps them.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">خلي الطلاب يقروا كتابتهم لبعض بيفيدهم.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">They hear what peers have written.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بيسمعوا كتابة زمايلهم.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-48"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:13", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How can you show you value good writing?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What can you do?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تثبت إنك مقدّر الكتابة الكويسة؟</div>", "o": ["Never assign writing", "Hide the best work", "Only fill-in-the-blank tasks", "Assign short real pieces and read quality work aloud"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not enough.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-48"}, {"id": "tefl-m10-practice-A:14", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Why seek funny punctuation examples?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why use them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه نستخدم أمثلة علامات ترقيم مضحكة؟</div>", "o": ["They show how punctuation can change meaning", "To avoid punctuation lessons", "To teach spelling", "To shorten sentences"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the reverse.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-48"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m10-practice-A.pdf"}], "tefl-m11": [{"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A", "model": "A", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is a phrasal verb?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is a phrasal verb?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">phrasal verb</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A verb with the suffix -ing", "A verb plus a preposition or adverb with a meaning different from its parts", "A verb used only in writing", "Any verb followed by a noun"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a participle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: for example come across means find.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are more spoken and informal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a transitive verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is correct?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is correct?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة صح؟</div>", "o": ["Madison looked on it up.", "Madison looked up it.", "Madison up looked it.", "Madison looked it up."], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a pronoun must split a separable verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: wrong order.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: a pronoun object must go between verb and particle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'The baby woke up early.' Which type of phrasal verb is 'wake up' here?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which type?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">'wake up' هنا من أي نوع؟</div>", "o": ["Transitive and inseparable", "A noun phrase", "Intransitive and inseparable", "Transitive and separable"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no object here.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is a verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: it has no object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it has no object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is a prepositional phrase?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">prepositional phrase</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Two prepositions together", "A preposition plus its object and modifiers, like on the table", "A noun and an adjective", "A verb plus a particle"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: phrasal verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'This is what I was talking about.' What is 'about' here?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is it?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه 'about' هنا؟</div>", "o": ["A complex preposition", "A prefix", "A conjunction", "A stranded preposition"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that has more than one word.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: left after its noun.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Prepositions change their form in the plural, like in the boxes.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">حروف الجر بتتغير في الجمع.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. They take no inflections.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. مبتتغيرش.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">They take no inflections.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">مبتتغيرش.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is a first conditional?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is first conditional?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة <span class=\"en\">first conditional</span>؟</div>", "o": ["If you heat ice, it melts.", "If I found money, I'd give it to the police.", "If I study hard, I'll pass my exams.", "If Maria had come, you could have told her."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: zero conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: second conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: if + present simple, will + stem.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: third conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-51"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is correct?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is correct?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أيهم صح؟</div>", "o": ["If it rains tomorrow, I'll stay in.", "If it will rain tomorrow, I'll stay in.", "If it rains tomorrow, I stayed in.", "If it rained tomorrow, I stay in."], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: no will in the if clause.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no will after if here.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: wrong result tense.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: tenses do not fit.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-51"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is a third conditional?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is third conditional?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي جملة <span class=\"en\">third conditional</span>؟</div>", "o": ["I would have more money if I didn't smoke.", "Babies cry if they are hungry.", "I'm sure Maria would've come if John hadn't forgotten.", "If I see Valeria, I'll tell her."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: second conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: zero conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: if + past perfect, would have + participle.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: first conditional.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-51"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is correct?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is correct?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أيهم صح؟</div>", "o": ["John tell me he is ready.", "John told he was ready.", "John told me he was ready.", "John said me he was ready."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: tense and form.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: tell needs an object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: tell needs an indirect object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: say has no indirect object.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-52"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">When can you keep the tense unchanged in reported speech?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">When no backshift?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إمتى منغيّرش الزمن؟</div>", "o": ["Only in the past perfect", "When the statement is still true", "Only with questions", "Never"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the rule.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: John said his foot hurts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the rule.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: there are exceptions.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-52"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-A:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Where are you going?' she asked. Which is the correct reported form?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Report the question.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">حوّل السؤال.</div>", "o": ["She asked where are you going.", "She asked where was I going.", "She asked where I was going.", "She asked do I go where."], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no backshift or pronoun change.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: keep statement order.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: normal word order and backshift.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-52"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m11-practice-A.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B", "model": "B", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does 'come across' mean in 'I've just come across it'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Meaning of come across?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">معنى <span class=\"en\">come across</span>؟</div>", "o": ["Scolded", "Remembered", "Walked over a bridge", "Found by chance"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is come down on.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is come back to.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: literal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:2", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Phrasal verbs exist only in English.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">phrasal verbs</span> موجودة في الإنجليزي بس.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Many languages have them in other shapes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. لغات كتير فيها.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Many languages have them in other shapes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">لغات كتير فيها.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which approach does the unit recommend for teaching phrasal verbs?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Best approach?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أفضل طريقة؟</div>", "o": ["Give long random lists", "Teach them in small sets inside everyday topics", "Pick every combination of one verb at once", "Avoid them completely"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a trap.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: food, phones, shopping, travel.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a trap.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: learners need them.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">'Get up to' means doing. What is special about it?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Why is it hard?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">ليه صعب؟</div>", "o": ["It has no verb", "It is a three-part phrasal verb made of known words with a new meaning", "It is always formal", "It is not used in English"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: get is the verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: usually informal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: it is used.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-49"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:5", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What is an idiom?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What is an idiom?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه الـ <span class=\"en\">idiom</span>؟</div>", "o": ["A fixed phrase with a figurative meaning", "A mistake in grammar", "A word with two spellings", "A grammar rule"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: for example the apple of my eye.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:6", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How should you introduce idioms?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How to introduce them?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تقدم الـ <span class=\"en\">idioms</span>؟</div>", "o": ["By their historical origin only", "In context, grouped with topics, and recycled later", "As five random items", "Only in formal writing"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: do not get hung up on derivations.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: random introduction fails.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: they are used widely.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:7", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Idioms are not used in formal writing at all.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">الـ <span class=\"en\">idioms</span> متستخدمش في الكتابة الرسمية.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Phrases like open the door appear in academic and business texts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. بتظهر في نصوص أكاديمية.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Phrases like open the door appear in academic and business texts.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">بتظهر في نصوص أكاديمية.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which category does 'she dived into the pool' belong to?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which category?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي فئة؟</div>", "o": ["Linking with adjectives", "Direction", "Manner", "Time"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no adjective.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not manner.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no time word.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-50"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:9", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">In a zero conditional, you can replace 'if' with 'when'.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">في الـ <span class=\"en\">zero conditional</span> ممكن تستبدل <span class=\"en\">if</span> بـ <span class=\"en\">when</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">The result is always true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">النتيجة دايمًا صحيحة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-51"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What does 'unless' mean?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does unless mean?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">يعني إيه <span class=\"en\">unless</span>؟</div>", "o": ["If not", "Until", "Although", "Because"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: I'm not going unless Jane comes.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-51"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which word introduces a reported yes/no question?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which word?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي كلمة بتقدم سؤال نعم/لا؟</div>", "o": ["if or whether", "that", "when only", "who only"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: for statements.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-52"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-B:12", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How does 'now' usually change in reported speech?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What does now become?</div><div class=\"q-ar\"><span class=\"en\">now</span> بتبقى إيه؟</div>", "o": ["then", "here", "today", "next"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: time expressions shift.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: that is a place word.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-52"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m11-practice-B.pdf"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C", "model": "C", "items": [{"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:1", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is correct?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is correct?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أيهم صح؟</div>", "o": ["She should be here by now.", "She do should be here by now.", "She shoulds be here by now.", "She should to be here by now."], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: modal + verb stem, no -s.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no do with a modal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: modals take no -s.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no to after a modal.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:2", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which question is correct?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which question is right?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي سؤال صح؟</div>", "o": ["How should I organise my room?", "How do I should organise my room?", "How should I to organise my room?", "How I should organise my room?"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: the modal goes before the subject.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no do with modals.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no to.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: needs inversion.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:3", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which sentence is wrong and why?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which is wrong?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أيهم غلط؟</div>", "o": ["We may be shown the figures", "You will must come soon: two modals cannot be used together", "You must come soon", "You may be waiting"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: modal plus passive is fine.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: this is fine.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: modal plus continuous is fine.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:4", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How do we talk about past obligation with 'must'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Past of must?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي نعبر عن الإلزام في الماضي؟</div>", "o": ["Use musted", "Use will must", "Use had to", "Use must had"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: does not exist.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: two modals.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: musted does not exist.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:5", "type": "msel", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which are modal verbs? Tick all that apply.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Tick the modal verbs.</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي دول modal verbs؟ اختار كل الصح.</div><div class=\"q-note\">Tick ALL that apply. / اختار كل الإجابات الصح.</div>", "o": ["might", "eat", "ought to", "should"], "a": [0, 2, 3], "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: a normal verb.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:6", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A modal verb is followed by the base verb without 'to'.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">بعد الـ <span class=\"en\">modal</span> الفعل بدون <span class=\"en\">to</span>.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">For example: you could go on Saturday.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">مثال.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is true.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:7", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which modal use means giving permission?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which gives permission?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي استخدام بيدي إذن؟</div>", "o": ["You may play with the tablet once you have finished.", "It will be windy.", "I can speak four languages.", "They might give us a lift."], "a": 0, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: prediction.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: ability.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: possibility.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-53"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:8", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What was the aim of Catherine's lesson?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What was the aim?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إيه هدف الدرس؟</div>", "o": ["Practising future plans", "Learning phrasal verbs", "Talking about what people should or should not have done in a past situation", "Reading for gist only"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: not the aim.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-54"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:9", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">How did Catherine deal with the grammatical form?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">How was the form dealt with?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">إزاي تعاملت مع الشكل؟</div>", "o": ["She gave a written test first", "She skipped the form", "She elicited it after pair discussion and highlighted it on the board", "She read the rule only"], "a": 2, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: no.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: she highlighted it.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: more effective than explaining.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: she elicited.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>"], "l": "tefl-54"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:10", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">Which is a good concept question for 'They would have taken your mobile if they had seen it'?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">Which concept question?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">أي سؤال مفهوم مناسب؟</div>", "o": ["Is this a third conditional with a perfect modal?", "Did they take it, would have?", "What colour was the mobile?", "Did they see his mobile?"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: too much terminology.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: reuses the target language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: irrelevant.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: short, simple, no target language.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-54"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:11", "type": "mc4", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">What should you do when a student asks an unrelated tricky question?</div><div class=\"q-simple\">What to do?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">لو الطالب سأل سؤال خارج الموضوع؟</div>", "o": ["Tell them never to ask", "Ignore it forever", "Stop the lesson and research", "Note it down and answer later"], "a": 3, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: rude.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: answer later.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: loses focus.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Right: stay with the lesson focus.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">صح.</div>"], "l": "tefl-54"}, {"id": "tefl-m11-practice-C:12", "type": "tf", "q": "<div class=\"q-hard\">A concept question should reuse the target language so students recognise it.</div><div class=\"q-simple\">True or false?</div><div class=\"q-ar\">سؤال المفهوم لازم يعيد اللغة المستهدفة.</div>", "o": ["True", "False"], "a": 1, "ex": ["<div class=\"ex-en\">Wrong: the statement is false. Avoid the target language and use simple words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">غلط: العبارة غلط. تجنب اللغة المستهدفة.</div>", "<div class=\"ex-en\">Avoid the target language and use simple words.</div><div class=\"ex-ar\">تجنب اللغة المستهدفة.</div>"], "l": "tefl-54"}], "pdf": "exampdf/tefl-m11-practice-C.pdf"}]};